<node id="Dead Loop Or Infinite Recursion">
  <data key="d0">Dead Loop Or Infinite Recursion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dead loop or infinite recursion is a common cause of high CPU usage, characterized by a single process consuming nearly 100% CPU.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a0e63fa705cdfb51ad486359ef39ca5</data>
  <data key="d4">cpu_high_usage.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068840</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Traffic Surge">
  <data key="d0">Traffic Surge</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Traffic surge is a common cause of high CPU usage, characterized by an increase in request volume leading to uniformly high CPU usage across multiple processes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a0e63fa705cdfb51ad486359ef39ca5</data>
  <data key="d4">cpu_high_usage.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068840</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Overlapping Scheduled Tasks">
  <data key="d0">Overlapping Scheduled Tasks</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Overlapping scheduled tasks is a common cause of high CPU usage, characterized by periodic spikes in CPU usage at specific times.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a0e63fa705cdfb51ad486359ef39ca5</data>
  <data key="d4">cpu_high_usage.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068840</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Slow Database Queries">
  <data key="d0">Slow Database Queries</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Slow database queries is a common cause of high CPU usage, characterized by high CPU usage in applications with simple business logic and slow SQL execution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a0e63fa705cdfb51ad486359ef39ca5</data>
  <data key="d4">cpu_high_usage.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068840</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
