<node id="Tokyo Electric Power Company (Tepco)">
  <data key="d0">Tokyo Electric Power Company (Tepco)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Tokyo Electric Power Company (TEPCO) is an organization that issued bonds and was involved in misusing raised funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Aig">
  <data key="d0">Aig</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">AIG is an organization that engaged in fraudulent financial disclosure to maintain bond prices and investor confidence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial Audit">
  <data key="d0">Financial Audit</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Financial audit is a systematic process of examining and verifying an organization's financial records and statements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Due Diligence">
  <data key="d0">Due Diligence</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Due diligence is a comprehensive assessment of the prospective listed company's operations, financials, and compliance, conducted by the sponsor to ensure the company meets listing requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;A comprehensive investigation into the potential listed company's background, governance, operations, and financials.&lt;SEP&gt;Due diligence is a comprehensive appraisal of a business or person prior to signing a contract or entering into a business relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;Due Diligence is a process conducted to verify the issuer's financial and operational information, including checks on shareholders and business transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of thoroughly investigating a potential investment or business partner to assess the level of risk involved.&lt;SEP&gt;Due diligence is the process of verifying the identity, qualifications, and intentions of the transaction counterparty to prevent money laundering and other illegal activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d1b26282ba6a164c58d78cc82cfdd6d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suspicious Transaction Monitoring">
  <data key="d0">Suspicious Transaction Monitoring</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspicious Transaction Monitoring is a systematic and manual process designed to identify and report any unusual or potentially illegal activities within financial transactions. This process aims to detect and report potentially illegal or fraudulent financial activities, ensuring that suspicious behaviors are investigated and reported to the appropriate authorities.

The monitoring involves using a suspicious transaction model to systematically monitor and manually investigate suspicious behaviors. These behaviors can include rapid transfers of newly purchased bonds at significantly different prices, unclear sources of funds, and unexplained delays in receiving investor funds. Additionally, Suspicious Transaction Monitoring focuses on the detection and reporting of unusual trading activities, particularly those that may indicate insider trading or market manipulation.

Suspicious Transaction Monitoring also involves the use of systems and rules to detect and report abnormal trading behaviors. Such behaviors can include false declarations, price manipulation, and trades that show a clear correlation between the timing of the trade and the release of significant announcements. By employing these methods, Suspicious Transaction Monitoring helps to maintain the integrity of financial markets and protect against various forms of financial crime.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d1b26282ba6a164c58d78cc82cfdd6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti-Money Laundering Blacklist">
  <data key="d0">Anti-Money Laundering Blacklist</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The anti-money laundering blacklist is a list of individuals or entities suspected of involvement in money laundering activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The anti-money laundering blacklist is a list used to screen clients for potential money laundering activities and significant legal violations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Anti-Money Laundering Blacklist is a list of individuals or entities that are flagged for suspicious or illegal activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The anti-money laundering blacklist is a list used to screen and identify individuals or entities that are suspected of money laundering activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d1b26282ba6a164c58d78cc82cfdd6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Regulatory Commission (Csrs)">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Regulatory Commission (Csrs)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) is a regulatory body responsible for overseeing the securities market in China.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bond Underwriting">
  <data key="d0">Bond Underwriting</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Bond underwriting is the process by which securities firms help issuers sell bonds to investors, often involving potential risks such as bribery and fraudulent activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="False Financial Disclosure">
  <data key="d0">False Financial Disclosure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">False financial disclosure involves the intentional release of inaccurate or misleading financial information to maintain market confidence and bond prices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Illegal Fund Transfer">
  <data key="d0">Illegal Fund Transfer</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Illegal fund transfer refers to the unauthorized or unlawful movement of funds, often associated with money laundering and other financial crimes.&lt;SEP&gt;Illegal fund transfer refers to the movement of funds through fraudulent means, such as using false information or manipulating accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Secondary Market">
  <data key="d0">Secondary Market</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The secondary market is where previously issued securities are bought and sold, and it can be used to launder illegal funds through the purchase and resale of bonds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="尽职调查">
  <data key="d0">尽职调查</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">尽职调查是核查发行人股权、销售业务环节、财务会计和风险因素等的过程，以发现潜在的财务欺诈和其他风险。&lt;SEP&gt;尽职调查是评估交易对方财务状况、业务前景和潜在风险的过程，通常由审计机构和法律顾问等完成。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-008da0ebf1260eb0b2aa14694543e31a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="发行人">
  <data key="d0">发行人</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">发行人是指在证券市场中进行股票、债券发行的公司或组织。发行人需要与证券公司签订《保荐协议》和《承销协议》，接受证券公司的保荐和承销服务，以确保其首次公开发行股票并上市的过程顺利进行。此外，发行人还可能涉及再融资的需求，在这种情况下，同样需要与证券公司合作，并接受其专业服务。

在股票发行过程中，发行人需要进行尽职调查和持续督导，以保证信息披露的真实性和完整性。发行人也可能通过公开募集资金来进行股票、债券的发行，这不仅包括在全国中小企业股份转让系统挂牌的情况，也涵盖了发行股票、优先股或可转债的情形。然而，发行人有时也可能存在一些问题，例如出资瑕疵、关联交易等，这些问题可能会对投资者造成不利影响。

值得注意的是，某些发行人可能通过发行债务融资工具来清洗非法资金，甚至存在欺诈发行债券和违规使用募集资金的行为。此外，在股票市场中，部分发行人可能存在不计成本大额买入自身股票的情况，或者利用媒体公布利好信息以维持股价。这些行为都违反了证券市场的公平原则，对市场秩序和投资者利益构成了威胁。因此，监管机构对于发行人的行为有着严格的监管要求，以保护投资者权益和维护市场稳定。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb8cec1c6f255b6854afdbe2659b4d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a27c8e629dfce0c6f1ac28620934cd1e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068917</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="财务审计机构">
  <data key="d0">财务审计机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">财务审计机构被聘请进行审计，但结果为无法出具意见。&lt;SEP&gt;财务审计机构负责对发行人的财务状况进行审计，可能存在资质不足或无法出具意见的情况。&lt;SEP&gt;财务审计机构是负责对发行人的财务状况进行审计的专业机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="反洗钱黑名单">
  <data key="d0">反洗钱黑名单</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">反洗钱黑名单是一份包含涉嫌洗钱行为的个人或组织名单，用于筛查可疑交易。&lt;SEP&gt;反洗钱黑名单是一份包含涉嫌洗钱或其他非法活动的个人或实体名单。&lt;SEP&gt;反洗钱黑名单是用于筛查和监控潜在洗钱风险的名单。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中国证监会">
  <data key="d0">中国证监会</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中国证监会是中国负责监管证券市场的政府机构，其主要职责包括制定和监督执行相关法律法规。作为证券市场的监管机构，中国证监会不仅负责对涉嫌犯罪或违法违规的行为进行立案调查，还负责批准注册上市公司的发行申请，并监管上市公司信息披露和再融资活动。

此外，中国证监会在确保市场公平、透明运作方面发挥着重要作用，例如发布关于基金投资顾问业务试点的通知以及批准上市公司的并购重组活动。该机构还负责监督和管理股票转让方式的批准，以确保市场的稳定性和健康发展。通过这些职能，中国证监会在维护投资者权益、促进资本市场健康发展中扮演了至关重要的角色。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-008da0ebf1260eb0b2aa14694543e31a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d80138c6a3f72889165a0ac781f32ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ddd5729ad3bfe1c8e0c43dddc95088</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="首次公开发行股票注册管理办法">
  <data key="d0">首次公开发行股票注册管理办法</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">首次公开发行股票注册管理办法是一部规定了股票发行过程中的禁止性事项的法规。&lt;SEP&gt;首次公开发行股票注册管理办法是中国关于IPO的规定文件，包含多项禁止性事项。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱高风险国家或地区">
  <data key="d0">洗钱高风险国家或地区</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱高风险国家或地区是指那些洗钱活动频繁或监管不严的国家或地区。&lt;SEP&gt;洗钱高风险国家或地区是指被认定为洗钱活动频繁的国家或地区。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="虚假利好信息">
  <data key="d0">虚假利好信息</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">虚假利好信息是指在公司上市前通过媒体散布的不实正面消息，企图抬高市场预期。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="募集资金">
  <data key="d0">募集资金</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">募集资金是指公司通过公开募股等方式筹集的资金，其使用情况需符合招股说明书上的资金投向。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="持续督导">
  <data key="d0">持续督导</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">持续督导是股票发行后对发行人进行的监督过程，关注股权变动、市场价格波动等。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="虚假财务信息">
  <data key="d0">虚假财务信息</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">虚假财务信息是指上市公司发布的不实财务数据，掩盖实际经营状况以维持股价稳定和投资者信心。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-178448d4c760748ffdd053f43352e226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="金融产品管理人">
  <data key="d0">金融产品管理人</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">金融产品管理人负责管理拟销售和推介的金融产品，并提供相关资料以供审查。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="营销管理部">
  <data key="d0">营销管理部</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">营销管理部负责收集金融产品及其管理人的基本信息，并进行登记和核实，同时关注客户身份资料疑点和资金来源疑点。&lt;SEP&gt;营销管理部负责收集和核实衍生品及其管理人的基本信息，并进行反洗钱调查问卷的评估。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="反洗钱信息报告员">
  <data key="d0">反洗钱信息报告员</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">反洗钱信息报告员负责复核系统录入的甄别分析情况，并对确认为可疑交易的报告进行复核和补充。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="反洗钱及合规监测中心">
  <data key="d0">反洗钱及合规监测中心</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">反洗钱及合规监测中心接收并处理可疑交易报告，确保机构符合反洗钱法规要求。&lt;SEP&gt;反洗钱及合规监测中心接收并处理来自营销管理部和分支机构提交的可疑交易报告。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="期货结算账户">
  <data key="d0">期货结算账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">期货结算账户是证券公司在期货保证金存管银行开立的用于期货交易出入金的银行账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="期货账户">
  <data key="d0">期货账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">期货账户是证券公司在期货公司开立的，用以登陆期货公司交易系统进行交易、清算、资金划转等业务的账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="自营类头寸账户">
  <data key="d0">自营类头寸账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">自营类头寸账户用于记载证券公司自身持有的场外衍生品合约，包括期权、期货、互换等衍生产品的买入、卖出和持仓等信息。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="保证金资金结算账户">
  <data key="d0">保证金资金结算账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">保证金资金结算账户在衍生品交易中，尤其是期货和期权交易中，需要缴纳一定比例的保证金来保证交易的履行，账户中的资金用于覆盖潜在的价格变动风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="自营资金结算账户">
  <data key="d0">自营资金结算账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">自营资金结算账户是证券公司在中证报价系统或商业银行开立的账户，用于记录证券公司自有资金的账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="客户">
  <data key="d0">客户</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">客户是投资组合的所有者，关注市场变化和投资产品的表现。&lt;SEP&gt;客户是指在证券公司进行金融产品交易的个人或机构，其经济状况、经营状况和信用情况需要通过公开信息和实时查询等方式了解。&lt;SEP&gt;客户是需要进行风险评估和尽职调查的对象，包括高风险和特等风险客户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ddd5729ad3bfe1c8e0c43dddc95088&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="特等风险客户">
  <data key="d0">特等风险客户</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">特等风险客户是被认定为具有极高洗钱风险的客户，需对其交易行为进行合理限制，并提高信息收集和更新频率。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="高风险客户">
  <data key="d0">高风险客户</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">高风险客户是被认定为具有较高洗钱风险的客户，需对其交易行为进行合理限制，并提高信息收集和更新频率。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="STR机制">
  <data key="d0">STR机制</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">STR机制是一种符合国际和本地反洗钱法律要求的方法，用于报告可疑交易，提升机构的合规性和信誉。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中证报价系统">
  <data key="d0">中证报价系统</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">中证报价系统是证券公司可以开立自营资金结算账户的平台之一，用于记录证券公司自有资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="商业银行">
  <data key="d0">商业银行</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">商业银行是金融机构，为证券公司开立融资专用资金账户和客户信用交易担保资金账户。&lt;SEP&gt;商业银行是证券公司可以开立保证金专用类资金结算账户和自营资金结算账户的金融机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3566130cc00e5cdcb12830dd00d0231f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77b36439da8f8202fe97a3d1f6b5a70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金管理公司">
  <data key="d0">基金管理公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">基金管理公司是依法设立的管理公募基金运作活动的公司，负责基金的募集、申购、赎回、投资和收益分配等。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c814bd3ee4b28cc811b0db9eb1dd67d1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="托管机构">
  <data key="d0">托管机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">托管机构是受公募基金管理公司委托，负责保管和管理基金资产的金融机构，主要为商业银行和证券公司。&lt;SEP&gt;托管机构是指具有合法从事资产托管业务资格的金融机构，一般为商业银行，负责安全保管资产管理计划财产，并根据合同约定开立专门账户，确保资产管理计划财产的完整与独立。&lt;SEP&gt;托管机构与证券公司建立长期合作关系，提供持续的账户管理、交易报告等服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c814bd3ee4b28cc811b0db9eb1dd67d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73108d0147d361b782facf1917eeaa00</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金销售支付机构">
  <data key="d0">基金销售支付机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">基金销售支付机构受基金销售机构委托，提供基金销售结算资金划转服务，一般由取得基金销售业务资格的商业银行或支付机构担任。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c814bd3ee4b28cc811b0db9eb1dd67d1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金销售结算资金监督机构">
  <data key="d0">基金销售结算资金监督机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">基金销售结算资金监督机构由中国证券登记结算有限责任公司或取得基金销售业务资格的商业银行担任，负责监督基金销售结算专用账户的行为和资金划转流程。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c814bd3ee4b28cc811b0db9eb1dd67d1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="注册登记机构">
  <data key="d0">注册登记机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">注册登记机构受基金管理人委托，为其提供对应基金产品的登记结算服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c814bd3ee4b28cc811b0db9eb1dd67d1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TA账户">
  <data key="d0">TA账户</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">TA账户是证券公司为基金管理人开立的，用于记录和维护各基金管理人产品销售情况的账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c814bd3ee4b28cc811b0db9eb1dd67d1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market Manipulation Event">
  <data key="d0">Market Manipulation Event</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Market Manipulation Event caused significant losses to stock investors and severely disrupted the normal order of the New Third Board market.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="New Third Board Market">
  <data key="d0">New Third Board Market</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The New Third Board Market is a financial market that has experienced issues with regulatory mechanisms, information disclosure, and market maker behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Listed Company">
  <data key="d0">Listed Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The listed company is a direct participant in M&amp;A activities, potentially buying or selling assets or changing control.&lt;SEP&gt;A listed company is an entity that has its shares traded on a stock exchange and may be involved in illegal fundraising activities.&lt;SEP&gt;A Listed Company is an enterprise listed on the New Third Board (National Equities Exchange and Quotations System). These companies are typically small and medium-sized or growth-oriented enterprises. They gain a public platform for financing and share circulation. Their main responsibilities include regular disclosure of financial information and operational status, ensuring corporate governance and transparency, and complying with market rules and regulatory requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Listed companies may have issues with transparency and accuracy in information and financial reporting, potentially concealing money laundering activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investor">
  <data key="d0">Investor</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An investor is an individual, institution, or entity that provides funds for various types of investments, including private equity funds, public funds, and other financial products. Investors can be categorized into individual and institutional investors, with the latter often consisting of high-net-worth individuals, enterprises, financial institutions, and other qualified institutional investors. These investors seek higher returns and have a certain level of economic strength and risk tolerance.

In the context of securities lending, an investor borrows funds or securities from a securities company to engage in trading, bearing the associated risks and obligations. They may also participate in the securities lending agency business as service recipients, primarily comprising institutional investors. Additionally, investors can purchase yield certificates through the securities company's counter market or the inter-institutional private placement product quotation and service system.

Investors are also involved in the initial public offering (IPO) process, where they provide the primary source of funds raised, influencing stock pricing and issuance volume. They evaluate companies, submit subscription letters, and transfer funds to underwriters for the purchase of stocks. In the case of bond subscription and allocation, investors receive one-time financial services from the securities company without needing to open an account or sign an agreement.

Furthermore, investors can be the final clients and beneficiaries of investment advisory services, entrusting investment advisors to provide professional advice and management to achieve their financial goals and investment returns. Institutional investors often enter into research service agreements with securities companies to receive market trend analysis and investment advice.

In the realm of private fund products, investors receive comprehensive information about the fund's investment strategy, risk and return characteristics, fee structure, and historical performance. They subscribe or purchase shares in the private equity fund, with their funds initially deposited into a dedicated fundraising settlement account. The information and transactions of these investors are managed by outsourcing institutions, and they may be affected by fraudulent activities.

Investors can also be involved in complex transactions or frequent trading to legitimize funds, especially when their background or source of funds is unclear. They are the ultimate holders and participants in the trading of fund shares, relying on liquidity providers and fund managers to ensure effective buying or selling of fund shares when needed.

In some cases, an investor may provide false identity information, engage in suspicious transactions, and use illegal assets as collateral. This highlights the importance of due diligence and regulatory oversight in the financial industry.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f911bfae3277fd2e4d6cbb22022ad159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce36971547dce4e14d361ad14139277e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908a90bfb004325d95720427d14fe150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eba1461291c2875357e4bf638923de9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1caa07f33ec0d99521d1f30e6329987c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Company (Market Maker)">
  <data key="d0">Securities Company (Market Maker)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Securities Company (Market Maker) provides continuous buy and sell quotes to ensure market liquidity and enable investors to trade stocks at any time. They maintain market stability and efficiency by holding and trading stocks in their own accounts and managing their financial and risk management capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;A securities company that acts as a market maker in the New Third Board, providing continuous buy and sell quotes to enhance market liquidity.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities companies, as market makers, can use their informational and financial advantages to create abnormal price fluctuations and engage in suspicious activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities companies act as market makers, providing continuous buy and sell quotes to ensure market liquidity and engaging in trades with investors based on these quotes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068918</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Money Laundering Risk Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Money Laundering Risk Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Money Laundering Risk Analysis involves examining the risks associated with various business activities, including market manipulation, insider trading, and collusive practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regulatory and Information Disclosure Stage">
  <data key="d0">Regulatory and Information Disclosure Stage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Regulatory and Information Disclosure Stage is a phase where incomplete or untimely disclosures by listed companies can increase money laundering risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market Making Trading Stage">
  <data key="d0">Market Making Trading Stage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Market Making Trading Stage is a phase where market makers facilitate stock transactions, which can be used by money launderers to break up large illegal funds into smaller transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-73cff566e738469c43a82462e7cb81d0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="拟上市公司">
  <data key="d0">拟上市公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">拟上市公司是指计划在证券市场上市的公司。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="企业">
  <data key="d0">企业</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">企业是通过发行债券来筹集资金的实体，用于业务扩展、项目建设或债务重组。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="政府机构">
  <data key="d0">政府机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">政府机构是通过发行债券来筹集资金的实体，用于基础设施建设和公共项目。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="主承销商">
  <data key="d0">主承销商</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">主承销商在债券发行过程中起主导作用，负责组织和协调整个发行过程。&lt;SEP&gt;主承销商负责汇总募集资金并将净额转入上市公司指定的账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d80138c6a3f72889165a0ac781f32ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="其他承销商">
  <data key="d0">其他承销商</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">其他承销商在债券发行过程中起辅助作用，协助主承销商进行市场推广、分销和销售工作。&lt;SEP&gt;其他承销商负责分销资金管理、认购款项收集、协调分配和销售、资金清算和转移。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="受托管理人">
  <data key="d0">受托管理人</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">受托管理人在债券存续期间提供信息披露督导、募集资金使用监督、信用风险监测及管理等服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="主承销商账户">
  <data key="d0">主承销商账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">主承销商账户用于接收投资者的认购资金，并汇总其他承销商募集到的资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="其他承销商账户">
  <data key="d0">其他承销商账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">其他承销商账户用于管理投资者的认购资金，并在证券分销过程中处理相关的资金流动。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="验资账户">
  <data key="d0">验资账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">验资账户用于确保公司在申请上市前满足最低资本要求，企业股东或其他出资人将资金存入验资账户，由会计师事务所进行验资并出具验资报告。&lt;SEP&gt;验资账户用于企业股东或其他出资人将资金存入，由会计师事务所进行验资并出具验资报告。&lt;SEP&gt;验资账户主要用于在公司再融资过程中，对投入资金的真实性和合规性进行验证。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="募集资金账户">
  <data key="d0">募集资金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">募集资金账户用于临时存放投资者认购IPO股份的资金，通常由保荐机构或募集资金监管机构开立并管理。&lt;SEP&gt;募集资金账户用于临时存放投资者认购债券的资金，待所有资金到位并确认后转入专项资金账户。&lt;SEP&gt;募集资金账户是专门为存放通过再融资活动所募集资金的账户，通常受到严格的监管，以确保资金仅用于指定的、公开披露的目的。&lt;SEP&gt;募集资金账户是上市公司指定的账户，用于接收募集资金的净额。&lt;SEP&gt;募集资金账户用于存放企业通过融资活动募集到的资金，确保资金的集中和安全。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb8cec1c6f255b6854afdbe2659b4d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="托管账户">
  <data key="d0">托管账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">托管账户用于临时托管募集资金，以确保资金的安全和监管。&lt;SEP&gt;托管账户在再融资过程中用于临时存放资金，直至资金被正式投资或使用，通常由独立的第三方托管机构管理。&lt;SEP&gt;托管账户是上市公司指定的账户，用于接收募集资金的净额。&lt;SEP&gt;托管账户用于临时托管募集到的资金，确保资金的安全和监管。&lt;SEP&gt;托管账户是为定向资产管理计划单独开立的银行结算账户，用于管理货币收支活动。&lt;SEP&gt;用于存放基金资产，确保资产的独立性和安全，通常由具备托管资格的机构管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb8cec1c6f255b6854afdbe2659b4d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b9c061447eeff077ab1d44fb1a678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="专项资金账户">
  <data key="d0">专项资金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">专项资金账户是企业为IPO募集资金专门设立的账户，用于管理和使用募集到的资金。&lt;SEP&gt;专项资金账户是企业为债券募集资金专门设立的账户，用于管理和使用募集到的资金。&lt;SEP&gt;专项资金账户用于管理特定项目或用途的资金，在再融资中可能用于跟踪特定投资项目的资金流动，确保资金按照既定计划使用。&lt;SEP&gt;专项资金账户用于管理和使用募集到的资金，确保资金用于融资计划中的具体用途。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb8cec1c6f255b6854afdbe2659b4d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="偿债基金账户">
  <data key="d0">偿债基金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">偿债基金账户用于定期存储偿还债券本息的资金，确保按期偿还债务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="结算账户">
  <data key="d0">结算账户</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">结算账户用于处理IPO过程中涉及的各类结算业务，包括发行费用的支付和投资者退款。&lt;SEP&gt;结算账户用于处理债券发行过程中涉及的各类结算业务，包括发行费用的支付和投资者退款。&lt;SEP&gt;结算账户用于处理与再融资相关的所有交易结算，包括股票或债券的买卖、分红派息以及与投资者的资金交割等。&lt;SEP&gt;结算账户用于处理融资过程中涉及的各类结算业务，包括支付融资费用和投资者退款。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bb8cec1c6f255b6854afdbe2659b4d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="债券">
  <data key="d0">债券</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">债券是一种固定收益证券，发行人承诺在未来支付利息并在到期时偿还本金。&lt;SEP&gt;债券是发行人通过发行债务融资工具筹集资金的金融产品，可能被用于清洗非法资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a27c8e629dfce0c6f1ac28620934cd1e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="公司债">
  <data key="d0">公司债</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">公司债是企业发行的一种债券，用于筹集资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="企业债">
  <data key="d0">企业债</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">企业债是企业发行的一种债券，用于筹集资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="金融债">
  <data key="d0">金融债</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">金融债是金融机构发行的一种债券，用于筹集资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非金融企业债务融资工具">
  <data key="d0">非金融企业债务融资工具</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">非金融企业债务融资工具是企业发行的一种债券，用于筹集资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资产证券化">
  <data key="d0">资产证券化</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">资产证券化是指通过设立特殊目的载体,以基础资产所产生的现金流为偿付支持，通过结构化等方式进行信用增级，在此基础上发行资产支持证券的业务活动。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2c6620bcd57579144e6af0b767cec8d7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="法律顾问">
  <data key="d0">法律顾问</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">法律顾问在上市公司和区域性股权市场业务中扮演着至关重要的角色，提供专业的法律服务以确保企业运营的合法合规。在上市公司再融资业务中，法律顾问不仅确保整个再融资过程符合法律法规的要求，还负责起草和审核相关法律文件，确保其合规性和有效性。此外，他们提供法律咨询，解决再融资过程中可能出现的法律争议，并帮助上市公司避免潜在的法律风险。

法律顾问的工作范围还包括为客户提供持续的合规管理支持。这不仅限于再融资活动，而是涵盖了企业的日常运营。通过与推荐机构的合作，法律顾问对客户进行深入的尽职调查，评估其法律合规情况，从而帮助企业识别并规避潜在的法律问题。无论是起草还是审核法律文件，法律顾问都致力于保证所有交易和股票转让活动遵守相关法律法规，确保企业在区域性的股权市场中的操作合规。

值得注意的是，法律顾问提供的这些专业服务并非无偿，他们会根据所提供服务的内容向上市公司收取相应的费用。这种收费机制反映了法律顾问工作的价值及其对企业合法合规运营所作出的重要贡献。总之，法律顾问是企业实现长期稳定发展不可或缺的一部分，通过他们的专业知识和服务，企业能够在复杂多变的法律环境中保持稳健前行。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-019519b30788d2c8b618269c7482b1f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a939557d5ed4e31ad418b7b30af6fc90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d80138c6a3f72889165a0ac781f32ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068919</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券交易所">
  <data key="d0">证券交易所</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">证券交易所负责审核上市公司的并购重组审批材料，并根据相关法律法规和监管要求批准并购重组活动。&lt;SEP&gt;证券交易所负责监管和批准公司的再融资计划，确保符合上市法规和监管要求，进行全面披露，并维护市场的公平性和效率。&lt;SEP&gt;证券交易所负责审核上市公司的申请材料，并安排股票的上市交易。&lt;SEP&gt;证券交易所是上市公司定期披露财务状况和经营情况的对象之一。&lt;SEP&gt;证券交易所负责对拟上市公司进行严格审核。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-008da0ebf1260eb0b2aa14694543e31a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a939557d5ed4e31ad418b7b30af6fc90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d80138c6a3f72889165a0ac781f32ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中国证券监督管理委员会">
  <data key="d0">中国证券监督管理委员会</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中国证券监督管理委员会(证监会)是负责监督和管理基金投资顾问业务的主管部门之一。&lt;SEP&gt;中国证券监督管理委员会是监管机构，负责制定和修订保荐业务相关的管理办法，对证券公司进行资格审批，并对违规行为采取监管措施。&lt;SEP&gt;中国证监会负责制定政策、规定和监管框架，引导证券市场的运作和发展方向，并审批上市公司的再融资申请。&lt;SEP&gt;中国证券监督管理委员会(证监会)负责对拟上市公司进行严格审核。&lt;SEP&gt;中国证券监督管理委员会(中国证监会)及其派出机构对地方金融监管部门的区域性股权市场监督管理工作进行指导、协调和监督。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-019519b30788d2c8b618269c7482b1f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a939557d5ed4e31ad418b7b30af6fc90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52b1f72cca6581350cf7ee13bfe210b0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中国证券登记结算有限责任公司">
  <data key="d0">中国证券登记结算有限责任公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中国证券登记结算有限责任公司负责处理IPO过程中涉及的各类结算业务，包括发行费用的支付和投资者退款。&lt;SEP&gt;中国证券登记结算有限责任公司在IPO业务中主要负责证券登记、托管、结算和清算，确保证券市场的正常运作和投资者权益的保护。&lt;SEP&gt;中国证券登记结算有限责任公司负责证券登记、托管、结算和清算，确保证券市场的正常运作和投资者权益的保护。&lt;SEP&gt;作为监督机构，负责对私募基金的销售和份额登记业务进行有效监督，确保投资者资金安全，并促进数据的安全交换。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b9c061447eeff077ab1d44fb1a678&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="招股说明书">
  <data key="d0">招股说明书</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">招股说明书是证券公司在首次公开发行股票上市过程中准备的重要文件，用于向投资者披露公司的详细信息。&lt;SEP&gt;招股说明书是再融资过程中的一项重要文件，用于详细说明公司的财务状况、业务战略和风险因素。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="发行协议">
  <data key="d0">发行协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">发行协议是再融资过程中的一项重要文件，规定了发行的条款和条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="股东大会决议">
  <data key="d0">股东大会决议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">股东大会决议是再融资过程中的一项重要文件，记录了股东对再融资计划的决策。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="再融资计划">
  <data key="d0">再融资计划</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">再融资计划是公司为了筹集资金而制定的计划，包括发行新股或债券等。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="保荐协议">
  <data key="d0">保荐协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">保荐协议是证券公司与发行人之间签订的协议，明确双方在首次公开发行股票上市保荐过程中的权利和义务。&lt;SEP&gt;《保荐协议》是证券公司与发行人之间签订的协议，明确了双方在再融资过程中的权利和义务。&lt;SEP&gt;《保荐协议》是保荐机构与发行人签订的协议，用于规定双方在保荐过程中的权利和义务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="承销协议">
  <data key="d0">承销协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">承销协议是证券公司与发行人之间签订的协议，明确双方在首次公开发行股票承销过程中的权利和义务。&lt;SEP&gt;《承销协议》是证券公司与发行人之间签订的协议，规定了承销方式、承销费用、募集资金用途等。&lt;SEP&gt;《承销协议》是保荐机构与发行人签订的协议，用于规定双方在承销过程中的权利和义务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分销协议">
  <data key="d0">分销协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">分销协议是主承销商与分销商之间签订的协议，明确分销商在新股承销过程中的权利和义务，包括分销数量、价格、费用分成等。&lt;SEP&gt;《分销协议》是主承销商与分销商之间签订的协议，规定了分销商在承销团中的职责、权利和义务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Profit Forecasting">
  <data key="d0">Profit Forecasting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Profit forecasting involves the prediction of a company's future financial performance, which can be manipulated through various means such as inflating revenue or deflating costs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial Fraud">
  <data key="d0">Financial Fraud</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Financial fraud refers to the act of providing false or misleading information in financial documents, such as annual reports and prospectuses.&lt;SEP&gt;财务造假是指通过虚增营业收入、虚减营业成本或虚增利润总额等方式进行的非法行为。&lt;SEP&gt;Financial fraud refers to the act of deliberately misrepresenting a company's financial information, such as inflating revenue, deflating costs, or inflating total profits.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial Fraud refers to fraudulent activities such as providing false financial statements, concealing important information, or exaggerating business performance to illegally raise funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b76cb9d596e1bbda44d3d73e725e1c9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4fb72119f9dbf295f128313c2793d9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Client Due Diligence">
  <data key="d0">Client Due Diligence</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Client Due Diligence is the process of thoroughly verifying the identity and background of an investor, including checking against blacklists and validating provided information.&lt;SEP&gt;Client due diligence involves further investigating the source of an investor's funds and ensuring that their identity matches the scale of bond purchases.&lt;SEP&gt;Client due diligence is a process conducted during the client relationship to verify the authenticity and compliance of the client's financial and operational information.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of verifying client identity and assessing the legitimacy of their transactions, including during the onboarding and ongoing relationship phases.&lt;SEP&gt;Client Due Diligence is a process that involves verifying the background, registration, and compliance of fund managers and their products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Merger and Acquisition">
  <data key="d0">Merger and Acquisition</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Merger and acquisition (M&amp;A) is a business activity where companies combine or are acquired, and it can be a channel for injecting illegal funds into listed companies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insider Trading">
  <data key="d0">Insider Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">内幕交易是指并购重组当事人向他人泄露并购重组内幕信息，间接协助他人进行内幕交易，或直接实际控制他人账户进行内幕交易的行为。&lt;SEP&gt;Insider trading involves the use of non-public, material information by insiders to trade securities, which is illegal and can occur in M&amp;A projects.&lt;SEP&gt;Insider trading involves the use of non-public, material information to trade securities, which is illegal and unethical.&lt;SEP&gt;The illegal practice of using non-public, material information for personal profit.&lt;SEP&gt;Insider trading involves using non-public information to gain an unfair advantage in OTC derivative transactions, often correlated with the timing of significant announcements.&lt;SEP&gt;Insider trading involves using non-public, material information to make investment decisions, which is illegal.&lt;SEP&gt;Insider trading involves the use of non-public, material information to make profitable trades, which is illegal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d1b26282ba6a164c58d78cc82cfdd6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c4fb72119f9dbf295f128313c2793d9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Refinancing">
  <data key="d0">Refinancing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Refinancing is the process of raising additional capital after an initial public offering (IPO) or M&amp;A, aimed at further business development, expansion, and financial optimization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Capital Structure Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Capital Structure Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Capital structure optimization is a goal of refinancing, which aims to improve the company's financial structure, reduce financing costs, and enhance market and shareholder value.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fundraising Accounts">
  <data key="d0">Fundraising Accounts</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Fundraising accounts are various types of accounts used in refinancing, including fundraising accounts, special funds accounts, custodial accounts, and settlement accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self-Operated Settlement Reserve Account">
  <data key="d0">Self-Operated Settlement Reserve Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The self-operated settlement reserve account is used by the lead underwriter to manage, verify, and ensure the proper allocation of raised funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Comprehensive Settlement Reserve Account">
  <data key="d0">Comprehensive Settlement Reserve Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The comprehensive settlement reserve account is used by other underwriters for managing subscription funds, coordination, distribution, and settlement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investor Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Investor Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An account opened by investors at the securities company for the purpose of purchasing yield certificates and transferring funds.&lt;SEP&gt;The investor fund account is used by investors to transfer funds when purchasing equity financing securities.&lt;SEP&gt;The investor fund account is used by individual or institutional investors to pay for the subscription of securities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Investor Fund Account is used to hold funds for securities trading, complete fund settlement, and handle deposits, withdrawals, and payments during transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f911bfae3277fd2e4d6cbb22022ad159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Verification Account">
  <data key="d0">Verification Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The verification account is used to validate the authenticity and compliance of the funds raised during the refinancing process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Regulatory Commission">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Regulatory Commission</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) is the primary regulatory body in China responsible for overseeing and enforcing rules for the securities market. It formulates and enforces relevant laws, regulations, and policies to maintain market stability and ensure fair competition. The CSRC supervises a wide range of financial activities, including stock pledge business, margin trading, and short selling, as well as the registration and compliance of public fund products.

In addition to these responsibilities, the CSRC oversees the registration of bond issuance based on review opinions from stock exchanges. It also plays a key role in the financing business of growth enterprises, particularly in the NEEQ market, where it focuses on information disclosure regulation, market operation supervision, and investor protection. The CSRC is further tasked with investigating and monitoring potential criminal and regulatory violations in the financial market, ensuring that all participants adhere to the established rules and standards.

The CSRC also oversees and approves the activities of securities companies, including client asset management business and the management of collective asset management plans. This comprehensive oversight ensures that the securities market operates efficiently and transparently, protecting the interests of investors and maintaining the integrity of the financial system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa89605632d20528c35319a83e6cba49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7dbd2fb9dfe4697cc441ad5c5d230e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068920</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stock Exchange">
  <data key="d0">Stock Exchange</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Stock Exchange is an organization where securities, including stocks, bonds, and other financial instruments, are traded. It provides a platform for various transactions, such as stock pledge repurchase, bond trading, and the buying and selling of closed-end funds and ETFs. The main exchanges in China are the Shanghai Stock Exchange and Shenzhen Stock Exchange.

One of the primary functions of the Stock Exchange is to ensure transparency and standardization in the financial market. It accepts and processes declarations for stock lending and borrowing, confirming transactions and ensuring their effectiveness. Additionally, it facilitates the execution of authorized fund transactions by securities companies, handling transaction instructions and providing a venue for centralized trading.

The Stock Exchange also plays a crucial role in the regulatory process. It reviews and provides opinions on the issuance of shares and bonds, ensuring that these transactions meet regulatory and disclosure requirements. For example, it can review applications for issuing shares to purchase assets and provide feedback on whether the transaction complies with relevant regulations. Furthermore, the exchange can require on-site inspections for financial irregularities, helping to maintain the integrity of the market.

In the context of bond transactions, the Stock Exchange provides a trading platform and rules for secondary market trading, facilitating price discovery and ensuring the review and registration of publicly issued bonds. It also offers a range of facilities, including trading systems, electronic interfaces, and communication systems, to support bond trading.

For public fund transactions, the Stock Exchange acts as a transaction execution and data provider. It allows funds to issue buy and sell orders through securities companies, matches trades, ensures fairness and transparency, and records transaction data. After the trade, the exchange sends the transaction information to the securities company for verification and final settlement with China Settlement.

Overall, the Stock Exchange is a multifaceted institution that not only provides a venue and facilities for securities trading but also organizes and supervises transactions, implements self-regulation, and ensures the smooth functioning of the financial market.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa89605632d20528c35319a83e6cba49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c4760a101fdfc12af6e9c1fde67430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c5e431a5c82210c1ca0f12cc0dee7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bd0a1a4b7684d1f5c307a33d9226d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Listed Company">
  <data key="d0">Non-Listed Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A non-listed company is a private company that may inject illegal assets into a listed company through mergers and acquisitions, leading to money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Project Team Key Personnel">
  <data key="d0">Project Team Key Personnel</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Project team key personnel are individuals involved in M&amp;A projects who may be at risk of insider trading and need to have their associated persons' information monitored.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb7f2b61234399cfad87cc413eacd0b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market Manipulation">
  <data key="d0">Market Manipulation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Market Manipulation is the act of using borrowed funds or securities to influence market prices, often through high-volume trading or price manipulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The act of artificially inflating or deflating the price of a security to deceive other investors.&lt;SEP&gt;Market manipulation involves creating abnormal price fluctuations through collusive or deceptive practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Price Volatility">
  <data key="d0">Price Volatility</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Price volatility refers to significant and rapid changes in the price of a financial instrument, often caused by market manipulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market Maker">
  <data key="d0">Market Maker</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Market Maker is an entity that provides buy and sell quotes, market liquidity, and executes trades through a core account. They manage their position risk, including adjusting the structure and size of their positions.&lt;SEP&gt;Market makers are responsible for providing market liquidity by continuously quoting buy and sell prices, ensuring that investors can trade at reasonable and stable prices.&lt;SEP&gt;Market makers are entities that provide liquidity to the market by buying and selling securities at quoted prices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liquidity Service">
  <data key="d0">Liquidity Service</data>
  <data key="d1">service</data>
  <data key="d2">Liquidity service involves providing liquidity to the market, which can be used for illicit activities such as money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Abnormal Price Fluctuations">
  <data key="d0">Abnormal Price Fluctuations</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Abnormal price fluctuations are significant and unusual changes in the price of a financial instrument, often due to market manipulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Collusion">
  <data key="d0">Collusion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Collusion involves secret or illegal cooperation or conspiracy, especially to deceive others or gain an unfair advantage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Compliance">
  <data key="d0">Compliance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Compliance refers to the adherence to laws, regulations, and standards, particularly in the context of financial markets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Futures Introducing Brokerage">
  <data key="d0">Futures Introducing Brokerage</data>
  <data key="d1">service</data>
  <data key="d2">Futures introducing brokerage is a service provided by securities companies to introduce clients to futures trading and assist with related services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Company">
  <data key="d0">Securities Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Securities Company is a financial institution that provides a wide range of services to investors, including margin trading, short selling, and stock pledge repurchase. It acts as an intermediary and service provider in stock pledge transactions, providing financing services to meet the funding needs of clients. The company is responsible for assessing the value of the pledged securities and disposing of them if the client defaults. Additionally, it manages the funds and ensures the proper execution of the stock pledge business, including monitoring and managing the pledged securities.

The Securities Company also offers various other financial services, such as private fund distribution, where it opens cash accounts for investors and enters into distribution agreements with fund managers. It is involved in the sale of private equity funds, which may pose money laundering risks through fraudulent activities. The company issues yield certificates, providing credit and ensuring corresponding returns to investors. It provides securities investment advisory services, analyzing market conditions and recommending suitable investment plans. For public mutual funds, the Securities Company manages authorized accounts and provides investment advisory services.

In addition to advisory services, the Securities Company publishes research reports, primarily for institutional investors. It can act as a sponsor, lead underwriter, or distributor in an Initial Public Offering (IPO), providing tutoring, underwriting, and distribution services. The company conducts comprehensive due diligence on potential listed companies, prepares working papers, and submits application documents for review. It also provides one-time financial services, acts as a trustee, and serves as a financial advisor for bond issuance. The Securities Company helps design financing plans and conducts due diligence and pre-issuance guidance for prospective listed companies.

The Securities Company is also involved in proprietary trading using its own funds, investing in stocks, bonds, and other financial products. It formulates investment strategies according to company regulations and conducts transactions through exchange seats. The company engages in proprietary bond trading and OTC derivatives, with a specialized department focusing on complex financial instruments like options, futures, and swaps. It is responsible for internal controls and due diligence in these activities.

Furthermore, the Securities Company provides fund operation outsourcing services, including fundraising, investment advisory, share registration, valuation, and IT system support. It acts as a custodian for various types of asset management products, including public and private funds, and provides outsourcing services. The company is responsible for safekeeping fund assets, reviewing transaction instructions, and ensuring compliance with the Custody Agreement and legal regulations.

The Securities Company also assists in the opening of futures accounts and provides market information. It acts as the execution and settlement agent for public fund transactions, responsible for real-time verification of funds and securities, ensuring compliance, monitoring abnormal trading behaviors, and completing end-of-day clearing and settlement with China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (China Settlement).

However, the Securities Company faces several risks, including fraud and money laundering. Inadequate due diligence and risk assessment can exacerbate these risks. There have been instances where the company's staff may exaggerate product returns to deceive investors or be involved in insider trading by leaking inside information or directly controlling others' accounts. The company has also been implicated in assisting listing companies in illegal fundraising through false advertising.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f911bfae3277fd2e4d6cbb22022ad159&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa89605632d20528c35319a83e6cba49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce36971547dce4e14d361ad14139277e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f88db09cf8ffc393a8809d56be486363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7f12cdeb483c7deb72fe0b6a5c6a479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d165ce25e58cf7e24e46962ff373a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb11b0587a7113559ef65ba6e8e5d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77b36439da8f8202fe97a3d1f6b5a70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908a90bfb004325d95720427d14fe150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c5e431a5c82210c1ca0f12cc0dee7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d1b26282ba6a164c58d78cc82cfdd6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bd0a1a4b7684d1f5c307a33d9226d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eba1461291c2875357e4bf638923de9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f041cc71caafcf01504545df5a12ac8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1caa07f33ec0d99521d1f30e6329987c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Futures Company">
  <data key="d0">Futures Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Futures companies are financial institutions that handle futures trading, including the opening of futures brokerage accounts and managing margin accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;Futures companies are involved in providing services for futures trading and may facilitate illegal activities if not properly regulated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Futures Brokerage Account">
  <data key="d0">Futures Brokerage Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A futures brokerage account is an account opened with a futures company to record and manage futures trading activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Futures Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Futures Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A futures settlement account is a bank account used for depositing and withdrawing margin funds for futures trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Futures Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Futures Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">This account is opened by the fund manager at a futures brokerage firm to manage the margin for futures trading and is linked to the special account for custody funds.&lt;SEP&gt;A futures fund account is an account opened with a futures company for the transfer of funds between the futures settlement account and the futures fund account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Futures Company Margin Account">
  <data key="d0">Futures Company Margin Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A futures company margin account is an account opened with a custodian bank to hold margin funds for futures trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="集合计划">
  <data key="d0">集合计划</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">集合计划是一种允许杠杆交易的设计，可能存在个别机构或人员通过高比例杠杆设计获取高额收益。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资产管理业务">
  <data key="d0">资产管理业务</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">资产管理业务的投资交易分为场内证券交易和场外非标交易，存在内幕交易、操纵市场等犯罪风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="场内证券交易">
  <data key="d0">场内证券交易</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">场内证券交易中投资经理可能利用职务之便获取内幕信息谋取个人私利，存在内幕交易、操纵市场等犯罪风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="场外非标交易">
  <data key="d0">场外非标交易</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">场外非标交易中可能利用客户委托资产进行关联人融资等不当操作，存在利益输送、证券欺诈等犯罪风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068921</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点1">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点1是指发行人通过上市方式将非法资金混入公司经营业务中，完成资金清洗的风险。&lt;SEP&gt;不法分子可能提供虚假或伪造的身份信息，将来源不明的资金投入到集合资产管理计划中，实现非法资金清洗。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点2">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点2是指发行人通过虚增收入、利润、资产或虚减成本、费用、负债等方式，或隐瞒债务、诉讼等重要事实，以达到IPO条件的风险。&lt;SEP&gt;产品申赎不计成本，赎回时点异常或持有期短暂，客户在大量申购集合资管计划后立即全部赎回。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点3">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点3涉及通过申购或赎回环节更换对应银行卡，达到混淆资金链的目的。&lt;SEP&gt;通过申购或赎回环节更换对应银行卡，达到混淆资金链的目的。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点4">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点4</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点4涉及通过构造虚假事实,伪造各类证明文件,办理“假继承”和“假赠予”等过户手续，将基金财产过继或赠予相关人员或机构，继承人或受赠予人再赎回基金，清洗非法收益。&lt;SEP&gt;发行人可能通过各种手段违规占用上市公司融资资金，如通过虚假的交易或合同将资金转移到境外。&lt;SEP&gt;利用非交易过户洗钱，通过构造虚假事实和伪造证明文件办理“假继承”和“假赠予”等过户手续。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="客户尽职调查">
  <data key="d0">客户尽职调查</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">客户尽职调查是在客户准入阶段，通过公开渠道核查客户身份信息的真实性，了解客户资金来源及建立业务关系的目的。&lt;SEP&gt;客户尽职调查是对发行人股本/资金来源、日常经营活动进行初步核查，以及在立项后对发行人开展进一步尽职调查的过程。&lt;SEP&gt;对发行人的募集资金运用进行核查，关注募集资金是否投向洗钱高风险国家(地区)，以及是否与招股说明书上的资金投向一致。&lt;SEP&gt;客户尽职调查是在金融业务中对客户进行身份验证和背景调查的过程，以确保合规性和风险控制。&lt;SEP&gt;在客户准入阶段，利用公开渠道核查客户身份信息的真实性，了解客户资金来源以及建立业务关系的目的，并关注是否存在可疑行为。&lt;SEP&gt;客户尽职调查是一种方法，用于在客户准入阶段和业务关系存续期间对客户进行背景调查和关联关系核查。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bde91f7dac51fd9740211f5769bf3ed</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="名单筛查">
  <data key="d0">名单筛查</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">名单筛查是对投资者进行筛查，关注其是否命中反洗钱名单以及是否存在证券业违法违规记录。&lt;SEP&gt;名单筛查是在立项时对发行人进行反洗钱黑名单和其他重大违法行为的筛查过程。&lt;SEP&gt;在对投资者资质进行核查时，进行反洗钱名单筛查，关注其是否存在历史违规违法行为，是否可能涉及洗钱。&lt;SEP&gt;对投资者进行名单筛查，关注其是否命中反洗钱名单，且最新三年内是否存在证券业违法违规记录。&lt;SEP&gt;名单筛查是一种方法，用于检查受赠与方或继承方是否在反洗钱名单上或有违法违规记录。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可疑交易监测">
  <data key="d0">可疑交易监测</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">可疑交易监测是通过可疑交易模型进行系统监测，并人工排查可疑行为的原因，如确认可疑，则上报可疑交易。&lt;SEP&gt;可疑交易监测是通过系统监测和人工排查可疑行为的原因，并在确认可疑后上报可疑交易。&lt;SEP&gt;可疑交易监测是一种人工监测标准，用于识别和上报可疑的金融活动。&lt;SEP&gt;通过可疑交易模型进行系统监测，并人工排查可疑行为的原因，如确认可疑，则上报可疑交易。&lt;SEP&gt;可疑交易监测是一种方法，用于识别和报告可能涉及洗钱的异常金融活动。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="集合资产管理计划">
  <data key="d0">集合资产管理计划</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">集合资产管理计划是一种金融产品，可能被不法分子用于非法资金清洗。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非交易过户">
  <data key="d0">非交易过户</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">非交易过户是指通过构造虚假事实,伪造各类证明文件,办理“假继承”和“假赠予”等过户手续，将基金财产过继或赠予相关人员或机构。&lt;SEP&gt;非交易过户涉及通过构造虚假事实和伪造证明文件办理“假继承”和“假赠予”等过户手续，以达到洗钱目的。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6240bfa6b19538dee387322c986ac099&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Media">
  <data key="d0">Media</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Media, including traditional and new media, is used to spread false positive information such as reorganization and performance improvement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fraudulent Listing">
  <data key="d0">Fraudulent Listing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fraudulent listing involves financial fraud to cover up illegal sources of funds to meet financing conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Persistent False Disclosure">
  <data key="d0">Persistent False Disclosure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Persistent false disclosure involves continuously releasing false financial information to conceal actual business conditions, maintaining stock price stability and investor confidence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investors">
  <data key="d0">Investors</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Investors may use public mutual funds to launder illegal funds by providing false identity information or using others' accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals or entities who participate in the IPO process, assess the investment value, and submit subscription intentions.&lt;SEP&gt;Investors prepare and transfer funds to purchase bonds and receive regular reports on fund usage and project progress.&lt;SEP&gt;Investors include institutional and individual investors who provide funds or purchase securities in M&amp;A activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Investors may use illegal funds for subscription, laundering money through the fundraising process, and hide the identity of the actual controller through equity holding.&lt;SEP&gt;Investors are individuals who were induced to invest in XLXM through false advertising and misleading information, and signed equity investment agreements.&lt;SEP&gt;Individuals or entities that participate in the New Third Board by buying and selling stocks based on market maker quotes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f88db09cf8ffc393a8809d56be486363&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sudden Investment">
  <data key="d0">Sudden Investment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Sudden investment refers to individuals with inside or undisclosed information making large-scale investments in companies about to be listed on the NEEQ and then selling stocks after listing for profit transfer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lianxun Securities">
  <data key="d0">Lianxun Securities</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Lianxun Securities engaged in financial fraud by inflating revenue and profits and forging business contracts to meet the listing requirements of the NEEQ in 2014.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jinya Technology">
  <data key="d0">Jinya Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Jinya Technology mixed illegal funds into its accounts through related-party transactions and false transactions, leading to the termination of its listing qualifications in 2018.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Yinlong New Energy">
  <data key="d0">Yinlong New Energy</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Yinlong New Energy had some investors using illegal funds for subscription during its NEEQ financing in 2017, which was later discovered and led to penalties.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Huishan Dairy">
  <data key="d0">Huishan Dairy</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Huishan Dairy continuously released false financial information to maintain stock price stability, but was eventually exposed for financial fraud, causing a significant drop in stock prices in 2016.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Illegal Funds">
  <data key="d0">Illegal Funds</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Illegal funds refer to money obtained through illicit means, which may be used for fraudulent activities such as financial fraud and money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insider Information">
  <data key="d0">Insider Information</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Insider information refers to non-public, material information that can be used to gain an unfair advantage in the stock market.&lt;SEP&gt;Insider information refers to confidential and non-public information that can be used for insider trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f88db09cf8ffc393a8809d56be486363</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equity Holding">
  <data key="d0">Equity Holding</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Equity holding involves the ownership of shares in a company, which can be used to hide the identity of the actual controller and facilitate money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6ef9817f97ba1cd3380401bb3fdb99c3</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Sales Payment Institution">
  <data key="d0">Fund Sales Payment Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An institution that provides fund sales settlement and transfer services on behalf of fund sales institutions, typically a commercial bank with fund sales business qualifications or a payment institution with a Payment Business License.&lt;SEP&gt;Fund Sales Payment Institution is an institution entrusted by the fund sales institution to provide fund sales settlement fund transfer services, usually a commercial bank or a payment institution with a payment business license.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Share Registration Institution">
  <data key="d0">Fund Share Registration Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An institution responsible for the registration, custody, and settlement of fund shares. It can be managed by the fund manager or an appointed third-party institution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Valuation and Calculation Institution">
  <data key="d0">Fund Valuation and Calculation Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An institution responsible for fund accounting, valuation, and related information disclosure. The fund manager can handle these tasks independently or delegate them to a specialized institution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Manager">
  <data key="d0">Fund Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The Fund Manager is a professional responsible for the overall management of a fund, including the investment strategy, asset allocation, and daily management. They are tasked with making investment decisions, managing the fund's operations, and providing investment instructions to securities companies. The fund manager is also involved in fundraising, subscription, redemption, and profit distribution, and may enter into distribution agreements with securities companies to sell financial products and provide services to investors.

In some cases, the Fund Manager is responsible for the public fund product, but there can be concerns regarding the lack of clear investment arrangements and risk control measures. This can lead to potential fraudulent activities, such as creating fake fund products or engaging in illegal fundraising and financial fraud. Some fund managers have been listed on business irregularity or serious illegal and untrustworthy enterprise lists, highlighting the importance of proper oversight and regulation.

Additionally, the Fund Manager may decide to outsource certain operations to third-party service providers, which can include trading and settlement services. In the context of listed funds, they coordinate with liquidity providers to maintain market liquidity and meet investor trading needs. The fund manager is typically approved by the State Council's securities regulatory authority, ensuring that they operate within the legal and regulatory framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce36971547dce4e14d361ad14139277e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7f12cdeb483c7deb72fe0b6a5c6a479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-908a90bfb004325d95720427d14fe150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eba1461291c2875357e4bf638923de9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Custodian Institution">
  <data key="d0">Custodian Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Custodian Institution is a financial entity that plays a crucial role in the management and oversight of assets, particularly in collective asset management plans or directed asset management plans. When the 融出方 (lending party) is a collective asset management plan or a directed asset management client, the custodian institution is responsible for the custody of these assets. This includes the safekeeping, investment supervision, valuation, and accounting of the assets. 

The Custodian Institution also handles the transfer of funds into non-guaranteed fund settlement accounts and assists in the management and supervision of pledged stocks. A key responsibility is the settlement and clearing of funds, ensuring the correspondence between funds and shares. This ensures that the financial transactions are accurately recorded and that the assets are managed efficiently.

Additionally, the Custodian Institution is often a commercial bank or securities company entrusted by the private equity fund manager to keep and manage the fund's assets. They are responsible for the safekeeping of these assets, ensuring their safety and independence, and providing reports on the fund's asset status and operations. The institution also provides custody and settlement services for bonds, working closely with bond trading platforms to support securities companies. This involves the registration and custody of bonds, with both primary and secondary custody systems in place.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa89605632d20528c35319a83e6cba49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d165ce25e58cf7e24e46962ff373a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7c5e431a5c82210c1ca0f12cc0dee7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ma Moujun">
  <data key="d0">Ma Moujun</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ma Moujun, a former deputy manager and director of a state-owned petrochemical company's material procurement department, was involved in bribery and money laundering.&lt;SEP&gt;A former deputy manager and director of a state-owned petrochemical company's material procurement department, convicted of accepting bribes from 2002 to 2019.&lt;SEP&gt;Ma Moujun is a former deputy manager and director of the material procurement department at a state-owned petrochemical company who was convicted for accepting bribes and using the funds to invest in financial products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068922</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Manager or Registration Institution">
  <data key="d0">Fund Manager or Registration Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The entity that confirms the arrival of funds, calculates and confirms the number of fund shares, and transfers the funds to the fund custodian account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eca88e9c19c1f56a5fea30694315e711</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Exchange">
  <data key="d0">Exchange</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Exchange provides real-time market information and monitoring services to help the Securities Company manage risks.&lt;SEP&gt;An institution that executes on-exchange derivatives trading, providing a standardized trading platform and clearing services. It ensures the legality and compliance of transactions and implements effective monitoring measures to prevent illegal trading activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The exchange is the primary platform and regulatory body for the liquidity service business of listed funds, setting and supervising market rules to ensure fair and transparent operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d165ce25e58cf7e24e46962ff373a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Interbank Market Dealers Association">
  <data key="d0">China Interbank Market Dealers Association</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A self-regulatory organization for the interbank market, including the interbank bond market, interbank lending market, foreign exchange market, bill market, gold market, and derivatives market. It formulates and supervises the implementation of self-regulatory rules, business standards, and professional ethics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Quotation System">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Quotation System</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An institution responsible for over-the-counter (OTC) derivatives trading services, providing quotation, clearing, settlement, and risk management services. It requires participants to report important information to ensure market transparency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Counterparty">
  <data key="d0">Counterparty</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Counterparty refers to the other party involved in a financial transaction, which can be a financial institution or a customer.&lt;SEP&gt;The most important participant in derivatives trading, including financial institutions and other market participants. They engage in hedging, speculation, and arbitrage operations, involving significant capital inflows and outflows.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59c4760a101fdfc12af6e9c1fde67430</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regulatory Authority">
  <data key="d0">Regulatory Authority</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The main supervisory body for investment advisory services, including the CSRC and local financial regulatory authorities, which ensure the orderly operation of the business and protect investor interests.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulatory Authority, such as the China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC), investigates and monitors potential criminal and regulatory violations.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity responsible for supervising and managing the legality and compliance of derivatives business, ensuring fairness and transparency in the financial market. It investigates and handles abnormal transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regulatory Authority oversees and manages the New Third Board market to ensure fairness, transparency, and stability. The main regulatory body is the China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC), which formulates and implements relevant laws and policies, supervises market participants, and ensures accurate and timely information disclosure.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory authorities, such as the China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC), oversee and manage the market to ensure fairness, transparency, and stability, and enforce relevant regulations and policies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Custodian Bank">
  <data key="d0">Custodian Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Custodian Bank is a financial institution that plays a crucial role in the management and safeguarding of assets for various entities, including investors, securities companies, and public funds. It opens and manages credit cash accounts for investors, verifies their fund flows, and ensures the transparency and security of transactions. The bank provides tripartite custody services and transaction settlement services to securities companies, ensuring that all financial activities are conducted with integrity and accuracy.

In the context of securities lending, Custodian Bank is involved in the custody and management of securities and funds. It acts as a custodian in the stock lending and borrowing business, where it is responsible for the safekeeping and settlement of funds, thereby ensuring transparency and security. Additionally, the bank is tasked with verifying the receipt of assets, notifying the manager, and transferring assets to the dedicated account, which is essential for maintaining the integrity of the lending process.

Custodian Bank also plays a significant role in the proprietary business of securities companies by handling the deposit and withdrawal of funds. It serves a supervisory function to ensure the safety of these funds, thus providing an additional layer of security. Furthermore, the bank facilitates the transfer of funds between bank custody accounts and derivatives trading accounts, allowing securities companies to query account information and transaction history. This ensures that all financial activities are transparent and secure, protecting the interests of both the securities companies and their clients.

In the realm of public fund transactions, Custodian Bank is responsible for the custody and settlement of these transactions. It maintains the relationship between fund product accounts and bank custodial accounts, ensuring that all transactions are accurately recorded and that the funds are managed in a secure and transparent manner. This comprehensive set of responsibilities underscores the critical role that Custodian Bank plays in the financial ecosystem, providing essential services that support the smooth and secure operation of various financial activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb11b0587a7113559ef65ba6e8e5d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bd0a1a4b7684d1f5c307a33d9226d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Derivatives Trading">
  <data key="d0">Derivatives Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of financial transaction characterized by high frequency and continuity, involving the buying and selling of various derivatives. It is not a one-time financial transaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Proprietary Fund Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Proprietary Fund Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">An account opened by a securities company in the China Securities Quotation System or a commercial bank to record the company's own funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Margin Account">
  <data key="d0">Margin Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Margin Account is used by the Securities Company to hold collateral and funds for the securities lending and borrowing transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;A dedicated account opened by a securities company in the China Securities Quotation System or a commercial bank for margin requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Derivatives Trading Account">
  <data key="d0">Derivatives Trading Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">An account opened by a securities company in the China Securities Quotation System or other permitted institutions for conducting derivatives trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="并购重组">
  <data key="d0">并购重组</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">并购重组是指上市公司通过购买、出售或其他方式对其他公司的股权或资产进行整合，以实现业务扩展或优化。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-008da0ebf1260eb0b2aa14694543e31a</data>
