  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="支付与结算账户">
  <data key="d0">支付与结算账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">支付与结算账户是上市公司用于向目标公司支付定金或意向金的账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-008da0ebf1260eb0b2aa14694543e31a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="还款账户">
  <data key="d0">还款账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">还款账户专门用于处理银行贷款及其他债务的偿还工作，确保按期足额向银行还款。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-008da0ebf1260eb0b2aa14694543e31a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分红账户">
  <data key="d0">分红账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">分红账户负责管理对股东及投资者的利润分配，根据公司的利润分配方案，按时向股东和投资者发放分红。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-008da0ebf1260eb0b2aa14694543e31a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Company (Asset Manager)">
  <data key="d0">Securities Company (Asset Manager)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A legally established securities institution approved by the China Securities Regulatory Commission to conduct client asset management business. It provides services such as investment transactions, share registration, and information disclosure.&lt;SEP&gt;The Securities Company is responsible for managing the assets in the asset management plan, potentially engaging in high-leverage designs and improper profit transfers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d0120d1425d6042d436cea353e1805c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investor (Asset Entruster)">
  <data key="d0">Investor (Asset Entruster)</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">A natural person, institution, or financial product that meets legal, administrative, and regulatory requirements. The investor signs a management contract with the asset manager and custodian, entrusting their assets for management and paying related fees.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Custodian Bank (Asset Custodian)">
  <data key="d0">Custodian Bank (Asset Custodian)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A commercial bank authorized to conduct asset custody business. It safely keeps the assets, ensures their integrity and independence, handles settlement, and oversees the asset manager's operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068923</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sales Institution">
  <data key="d0">Sales Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An institution that sells asset management plans on behalf of securities and futures institutions. It verifies the investor's qualifications and ensures they meet the required conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sales Institution handles investor applications, verifies payments, and processes the transfer of funds to and from the collective asset management plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Collective Asset Management Contract">
  <data key="d0">Collective Asset Management Contract</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A contract between the investor and the securities company that outlines the rights and obligations, including investment goals, strategies, risk disclosures, fee arrangements, and profit distribution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Agency Promotion Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Agency Promotion Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">An agreement between the securities company and the sales institution that specifies the rights and obligations in the promotion and sales process, including promotional activities, risk control, and customer service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Asset Management Plan">
  <data key="d0">Asset Management Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Asset Management Plan is a financial product that manages investments for clients, potentially involving complex transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial product offered by securities companies to manage and invest clients' assets, with specific investment goals, strategies, and risk disclosures.&lt;SEP&gt;An Asset Management Plan is a financial product designed to manage and invest client assets, which can be used for money laundering through various means.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial product that can be used to launder illicit funds if not properly monitored and controlled.&lt;SEP&gt;An asset management plan is a financial product offered by various financial institutions, including securities companies, banks, trusts, insurance, and futures companies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8858efe5e3e58391d56ba5b4caeab936&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77b36439da8f8202fe97a3d1f6b5a70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d0120d1425d6042d436cea353e1805c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="客户控股股东">
  <data key="d0">客户控股股东</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">客户控股股东是指在公司中拥有实际控制权的主要股东。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="实际控制人">
  <data key="d0">实际控制人</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">实际控制人涉嫌资金占用，并可能涉及股份代持。&lt;SEP&gt;实际控制人是指对公司具有实际控制力的个人或实体。&lt;SEP&gt;实际控制人是指对公司具有实际控制力的人。&lt;SEP&gt;实际控制人在再融资过程中可能会参与，并有时作为再融资的一部分提供担保或承诺。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="上市公司">
  <data key="d0">上市公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">上市公司是证券公司撰写公司研究报告和行业调研的主要对象，其发行的股票在证券交易所上市交易。&lt;SEP&gt;上市公司是指其股票在证券交易所上市交易的公司。&lt;SEP&gt;上市公司及其管理层作为再融资的主体，需要制定再融资计划，决定融资规模、方式和用途。&lt;SEP&gt;上市公司是需要进行融资并发行股票或债券的企业，需提交申请材料给审计机构和法律顾问审核。&lt;SEP&gt;上市公司通过再融资获得资金，并向会计师事务所、法律顾问及保荐机构支付相关费用，同时定期披露财务状况和经营情况。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d80138c6a3f72889165a0ac781f32ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二级市场">
  <data key="d0">二级市场</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二级市场是指股票、债券等金融工具在首次发行后进行买卖的市场。&lt;SEP&gt;二级市场是投资者购买和转让债券的场所，可能被用于清洗非法资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a27c8e629dfce0c6f1ac28620934cd1e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="股份代持情形">
  <data key="d0">股份代持情形</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">股份代持情形是指实际股东通过他人名义持有公司股份的情况。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="募集资金投向异常">
  <data key="d0">募集资金投向异常</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">发行人将公开募集的资金投向洗钱高风险国家或地区，或资金投向与招股说明书不符，且无合理理由。&lt;SEP&gt;募集资金投向异常是指发行人将公开募集的资金投向与招股说明书不符且无合理理由的情况。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="持续性虚假披露">
  <data key="d0">持续性虚假披露</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">上市公司持续发布虚假财务信息，掩盖实际经营状况，维持股价稳定和投资者信心。&lt;SEP&gt;持续性虚假披露是指上市公司持续发布虚假财务信息，掩盖实际经营状况，维持股价稳定和投资者信心的行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可疑行为示例">
  <data key="d0">可疑行为示例</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">可疑行为示例包括股票、债券发行后迅速发生股权转移，且主要通过非公开方式进行操作，转让价格与股票价格偏差较大。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="管控设计和可行性分析">
  <data key="d0">管控设计和可行性分析</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">管控设计和可行性分析是指对洗钱风险点的控制措施的设计及其实施可行性的评估。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c333b77737b917031b521ea06868eb46</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="New Third Board">
  <data key="d0">New Third Board</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The New Third Board, also known as the National Equities Exchange and Quotations System, is a market for small and medium-sized or growth-oriented enterprises to list and trade their stocks.&lt;SEP&gt;A trading platform for small and medium-sized enterprises, where market makers provide liquidity through continuous buy and sell quotes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Listed Companies">
  <data key="d0">Listed Companies</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Companies that are listed on the New Third Board and whose stocks are traded by investors and market makers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (China Clearing) provides services such as securities pledge registration, clearing, and settlement after receiving confirmed transaction results from the stock exchange.&lt;SEP&gt;China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (China Clearing) is responsible for the clearing and settlement of margin trading and short selling transactions, providing securities registration and custody services.&lt;SEP&gt;The China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (CSDC) provides securities registration, custody, and settlement services in the NEEQ market, ensuring the accuracy of shareholder records and the security of securities assets.&lt;SEP&gt;China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation is responsible for the registration, custody, and settlement of securities, providing services such as account opening, holding registration, and clearing and settlement.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization that provides depository, clearing, and settlement services for securities transactions, including those on the New Third Board.&lt;SEP&gt;China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (CSDC) is the entity where securities companies open accounts for the settlement of public fund transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa89605632d20528c35319a83e6cba49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bd0a1a4b7684d1f5c307a33d9226d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7dbd2fb9dfe4697cc441ad5c5d230e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market Maker Service Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Market Maker Service Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">An agreement between the securities company (market maker) and the listed company, outlining the terms and conditions of the market making service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Inventory Stock">
  <data key="d0">Inventory Stock</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Stocks held by the market maker for the purpose of providing liquidity in the market, obtained through various methods such as shareholder transfers or stock issuance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="National Equities Exchange and Quotations (NEEQ)">
  <data key="d0">National Equities Exchange and Quotations (NEEQ)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Equities Exchange and Quotations (NEEQ) is responsible for reviewing and approving the listing and issuance of stocks for (prospective) listed companies, and it also handles self-regulation for companies with fewer than 200 shareholders.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulatory body overseeing the New Third Board, setting rules and requirements for market making and other trading activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Trading Hours">
  <data key="d0">Trading Hours</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The trading hours for the New Third Board are from 9:30 to 11:30 and from 13:00 to 15:00 each trading day.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Valuation Methods">
  <data key="d0">Valuation Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Methods used by the securities company (market maker) to determine the price of stocks, including valuation techniques and discussions with the listed company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stock Transfer System">
  <data key="d0">Stock Transfer System</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">A system that matches buy and sell orders and confirms trades, ensuring the transfer of funds and securities between buyers and sellers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4525eb1b81fc2ed35bf03d90b5d3a9ba</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="客户销售金融产品或提供金融服务的第三方">
  <data key="d0">客户销售金融产品或提供金融服务的第三方</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">第三方机构或个人，负责销售金融产品或提供金融服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f64d02762bb5f75d15997bc68bb7fd0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068924</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="交易对手">
  <data key="d0">交易对手</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">参与金融交易的另一方，可以是金融机构或客户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f64d02762bb5f75d15997bc68bb7fd0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
