  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">交易佣金模式是研究所的主要收入来源，投资者通过券商进行交易产生的佣金作为研究服务的对价。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="固定付费模式">
  <data key="d0">固定付费模式</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">固定付费模式是指个人或机构投资者直接与研究所签订研究服务协议，由研究所提供约定主题的研究报告，客户直接付费获得研究服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="转移支付模式">
  <data key="d0">转移支付模式</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">转移支付模式是一种极个别的模式，私募基金或券商资产管理部的客户常用，但2024年7月1日后禁止使用交易佣金向第三方转移支付费用。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="公募基金">
  <data key="d0">公募基金</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">公募基金是直接租用券商席位，获得交易所专门的交易单元，而不去营业部开户的机构投资者。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="私募基金">
  <data key="d0">私募基金</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">私募基金是需要在营业部开户并通过券商进行交易的机构投资者。&lt;SEP&gt;私募基金是指由基金管理人发行的非公开募集的投资基金，文中涉及多起非法集资和资金挪用案例。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b9c061447eeff077ab1d44fb1a678</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券公司(研究所)">
  <data key="d0">证券公司(研究所)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">证券公司(研究所)负责发布研究报告，为公募基金等机构投资者以及个人投资者提供研究咨询服务，并为公司重点业务和客户提供研究支持。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="第三方发布平台">
  <data key="d0">第三方发布平台</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">第三方发布平台与证券公司签订合同，获得授权在平台上发布研究报告，投资者可通过订阅或直接付费查看研究报告。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券估值">
  <data key="d0">证券估值</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">证券估值是对证券及证券相关产品的价值进行评估的过程。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="投资评级">
  <data key="d0">投资评级</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">投资评级是根据证券及证券相关产品的市场走势和影响因素，对投资价值进行的评级。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-08933fbc3615474d26ead556f79fde5c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shengtong Group">
  <data key="d0">Shengtong Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Shengtong Group is a company that engaged in financial fraud from 2013 to 2017 under the leadership of its then chairman, legal representative, and actual controller, Wang Xiusheng.&lt;SEP&gt;Shengtong Group issued publicly and privately placed bonds and was involved in illegal and regulatory violations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wang Xiusheng">
  <data key="d0">Wang Xiusheng</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wang Xiusheng is the former chairman, legal representative, and actual controller of Shengtong Group who organized and directed the financial fraud.&lt;SEP&gt;Wang Xiusheng, the former chairman, legal representative, and actual controller of Shengtong Group, made decisions and organized financial misconduct.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shengtong Steel Wire">
  <data key="d0">Shengtong Steel Wire</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Shengtong Steel Wire is one of the three subsidiaries used by Shengtong Group for financial fraud.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shengtong Chemical">
  <data key="d0">Shengtong Chemical</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Shengtong Chemical is one of the three subsidiaries used by Shengtong Group for financial fraud, which ceased operations in 2013.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shengtong Optics">
  <data key="d0">Shengtong Optics</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Shengtong Optics is one of the three subsidiaries used by Shengtong Group for financial fraud.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zhongtianyun Accounting Firm">
  <data key="d0">Zhongtianyun Accounting Firm</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhongtianyun Accounting Firm is the auditing firm that issued audit reports for Shengtong Group in 2016 and 2017.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jiangsu Tech Company">
  <data key="d0">Jiangsu Tech Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Jiangsu Tech Company is a company that engaged in fraudulent bond issuance, with Yang Ye as its representative.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Yang Ye">
  <data key="d0">Yang Ye</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang Ye is the representative of Jiangsu Tech Company who decided to issue private placement bonds to solve financing issues.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
