</node>
<node id="Beijing University of Technology Optoelectronic Technology Laboratory">
  <data key="d0">Beijing University of Technology Optoelectronic Technology Laboratory</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The laboratory collaborated with Jiangsu Tech Company to help set up production lines and provide technical support.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
