</node>
<node id="Yang Lun">
  <data key="d0">Yang Lun</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang Lun, a relative of Yang Ye, was responsible for public relations, coordination, business negotiations, and obtaining legal opinions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zhongshan Securities">
  <data key="d0">Zhongshan Securities</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhongshan Securities is the underwriter for the private placement bonds issued by Jiangsu Tech Company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068926</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jiangsu Ming Tech Company">
  <data key="d0">Jiangsu Ming Tech Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Jiangsu Ming Tech Company is a company that falsely subscribed to 7 million yuan of the bonds issued by Jiangsu Tech Company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
