  <data key="d0">Huabei Securities</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Huabei Securities is a securities company that paid a 5 million yuan kickback to a company to secure a bond underwriting business.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
