  <data key="d0">Jiangsu Yashi Investment Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Jiangsu Yashi Investment Group is a shareholder of Chuangyi Company that received a dividend of 1.1273 million yuan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-544ad37a02e1d092cc5521f45d203638</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="保荐机构(主承销商)">
  <data key="d0">保荐机构(主承销商)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">保荐机构在上市公司的再融资活动中发挥着核心作用，负责尽职调查、设计再融资方案、准备法律文件并推介再融资项目。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="承销团(分销商)">
  <data key="d0">承销团(分销商)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">承销团通常由主承销商和其他承销商组成，负责证券的发行和销售，分担发行风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="再融资业务">
  <data key="d0">再融资业务</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">再融资业务是一个多阶段的复杂过程，涵盖了从尽职调查、融资方案设计到资金筹集和管理的全过程，需要持续规划和管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="控股股东">
  <data key="d0">控股股东</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">控股股东在再融资过程中可能会参与，并有时作为再融资的一部分提供担保或承诺。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f061b60164724fecf3b57cb08bcae658</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial Product Distribution Business">
  <data key="d0">Financial Product Distribution Business</data>
  <data key="d1">business</data>
  <data key="d2">Financial Product Distribution Business involves the distribution of various financial products.&lt;SEP&gt;The financial product distribution business involves securities companies acting as intermediaries to sell financial products from issuers such as funds, trusts, and banks, and it includes a wide range of products like wealth management, investment certificates, and more.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59c4760a101fdfc12af6e9c1fde67430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Public Fund Distribution Business">
  <data key="d0">Public Fund Distribution Business</data>
  <data key="d1">business</data>
  <data key="d2">Public Fund Distribution Business involves the distribution of publicly offered funds.&lt;SEP&gt;The public fund distribution business involves securities companies selling public fund products on behalf of fund management companies, providing services like account opening, subscription, purchase, and redemption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59c4760a101fdfc12af6e9c1fde67430&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Fund Distribution Business">
  <data key="d0">Private Fund Distribution Business</data>
  <data key="d1">business</data>
  <data key="d2">Private Fund Distribution Business involves the distribution of privately offered funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59c4760a101fdfc12af6e9c1fde67430</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Income Certificate Issuance and Sales Business">
  <data key="d0">Income Certificate Issuance and Sales Business</data>
  <data key="d1">business</data>
  <data key="d2">Income Certificate Issuance and Sales Business involves the issuance and sales of income certificates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59c4760a101fdfc12af6e9c1fde67430</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
