<node id="Research Content and Method">
  <data key="d0">Research Content and Method</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Research Content and Method refers to the detailed study of non-brokerage business types, divided into 7 modules: business definition and concept, business characteristics, customer identification, information/funds flow, related money laundering or upstream crime cases, money laundering risk penetration analysis, and control measures design and feasibility analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-59c4760a101fdfc12af6e9c1fde67430</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investment Manager">
  <data key="d0">Investment Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The Investment Manager is responsible for issuing trading instructions, both on-exchange and off-exchange, and overseeing the execution of trades.&lt;SEP&gt;An individual who may engage in illegal activities such as insider trading, market manipulation, and other criminal activities for personal gain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Client">
  <data key="d0">Client</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual or entity that may attempt to evade regulatory scrutiny by directing funds to third parties, posing a risk of money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Criminal">
  <data key="d0">Criminal</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An individual who may use complex transaction structures and false identity information to launder illicit funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Customized Product">
  <data key="d0">Private Customized Product</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial product that may be designed with complex transaction structures to evade regulatory oversight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Watchlist Screening">
  <data key="d0">Watchlist Screening</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process of checking clients against a list of known or suspected criminals, including those with a history of securities violations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Suspicious Behavior">
  <data key="d0">Suspicious Behavior</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Behaviors that indicate potential illegal activities, such as using relatives' accounts for trading or controlling multiple accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Custodian">
  <data key="d0">Custodian</data>
  <data key="d1">role</data>
  <data key="d2">The Custodian is responsible for verifying the NAV and cumulative NAV calculated by the Securities Company's valuation system and transmitting the verified values to the TA system.&lt;SEP&gt;A custodian is a licensed institution with the qualifications to provide fund custody services, including fund raising, investment advisory, share registration, valuation, and IT system services.&lt;SEP&gt;Custodian, typically a commercial bank or a securities company with custodial qualifications, is responsible for the safekeeping of fund assets, ensuring their independence and integrity, establishing reconciliation mechanisms, and regularly verifying fund positions and securities accounts. The custodian works closely with the securities company to ensure the safety of fund assets and the smooth execution of transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Management Company">
  <data key="d0">Fund Management Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A fund management company is an entity that manages the assets of a fund and can delegate certain functions to a custodian.&lt;SEP&gt;Fund Management Company is the operational entity of public funds, responsible for portfolio management, subscription and redemption execution, and investment strategy formulation. It collaborates closely with securities companies, custodians, stock exchanges, and clearing institutions to ensure the safe and efficient transfer and settlement of funds and securities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068927</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Public Fund">
  <data key="d0">Public Fund</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A public fund is a type of investment fund that is open to the general public and is managed by a fund management company.&lt;SEP&gt;Public funds are managed by fund managers and engage in securities exchange transactions, with settlement services provided by securities companies.&lt;SEP&gt;Public Fund is a financial product that requires the establishment of securities and capital accounts with a securities company for settlement services.&lt;SEP&gt;Public Fund is a financial product that pools money from multiple investors to invest in securities, managed by a Fund Management Company and traded through Securities Companies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7f12cdeb483c7deb72fe0b6a5c6a479</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Fund">
  <data key="d0">Private Fund</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A private fund is an investment fund that is not publicly traded and is managed by a fund management company, including private securities investment funds and private equity investment funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Outsourcing Services">
  <data key="d0">Outsourcing Services</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Outsourcing services include fund raising, investment advisory, share registration, valuation, and IT system services provided by securities companies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (CSDC)">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (CSDC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CSDC is responsible for deducting handling fees and pledge registration fees, and transferring funds between the non-guaranteed fund settlement accounts of the parties involved.&lt;SEP&gt;The organization responsible for providing registration and settlement services for stock lending and borrowing transactions conducted through the stock exchange and CSFC.&lt;SEP&gt;The CSDC is a financial institution in China that provides depository and clearing services for securities transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;CSDC is the entity responsible for adjusting the balance of the client's settlement margin account based on the settlement situation of the public fund.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7f12cdeb483c7deb72fe0b6a5c6a479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d165ce25e58cf7e24e46962ff373a86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="People's Bank of China (PBOC)">
  <data key="d0">People's Bank of China (PBOC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The PBOC is the central bank of China and is involved in the regulation and supervision of financial activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Central Depository &amp; Clearing Co., Ltd. (CCDC)">
  <data key="d0">China Central Depository &amp; Clearing Co., Ltd. (CCDC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CCDC is a financial institution in China that provides depository and clearing services for bond transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shanghai Clearing House">
  <data key="d0">Shanghai Clearing House</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Shanghai Clearing House is a financial institution in China that provides depository and clearing services for financial transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Account for Fund Raising and Settlement">
  <data key="d0">Special Account for Fund Raising and Settlement</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">This account is used for the collection and payment of funds during the fund raising period and the fund's operation, including subscriptions, redemptions, dividends, and fees.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Account for Custody Funds">
  <data key="d0">Special Account for Custody Funds</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">This account is opened by the custodian at a qualified commercial bank to manage the cash assets of the fund.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A securities account is an account opened by the client at the securities company to facilitate investment transactions and advisory services.&lt;SEP&gt;This account is opened by the custodian or fund manager at the CSDC branches in Shanghai and Shenzhen for the fund's securities transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">This account is opened by the fund manager at a securities brokerage firm for the settlement of securities transactions and is linked to the special account for custody funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distributor's Account">
  <data key="d0">Distributor's Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">This account is used to collect fees such as subscription, purchase, and redemption fees that are specified in the fund contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Settlement Reserve Account for Custodian">
  <data key="d0">Settlement Reserve Account for Custodian</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">This account is opened by the securities company at the CSDC branches to handle the settlement of exchange-traded funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Electronic Bookkeeping Account and DVP Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Electronic Bookkeeping Account and DVP Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">These accounts are opened at the CCDC and Shanghai Clearing House to record the holdings and changes in the bond investments and to manage the DVP (Delivery versus Payment) transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-17aa5e3182daf9a08811227ca353265a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金投资者">
  <data key="d0">基金投资者</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">基金投资者是依法可以投资于私募基金的个人投资者、机构投资者以及法律法规或中国证监会允许购买私募基金的其他投资者。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d180a84c8f6a53a2219f766762578e2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金份额持有人">
  <data key="d0">基金份额持有人</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">基金份额持有人是履行出资义务取得基金份额的基金投资者。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d180a84c8f6a53a2219f766762578e2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="募集账户监督机构">
  <data key="d0">募集账户监督机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">募集账户监督机构负责监督本基金募集结算资金划转安全，确保募集结算资金专用账户的资金安全。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d180a84c8f6a53a2219f766762578e2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金代销机构">
  <data key="d0">基金代销机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">基金代销机构负责按照基金管理人的委托向投资者推销和销售基金产品，并接受投资者的认购或申购资金，将资金归集至募集结算资金专用账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d180a84c8f6a53a2219f766762578e2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="私募基金服务机构">
  <data key="d0">私募基金服务机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">私募基金服务机构接受基金管理人委托，为本基金提供份额登记、估值核算等服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d180a84c8f6a53a2219f766762578e2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DVP资金账户">
  <data key="d0">DVP资金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">DVP资金账户是用于记录和管理债券投资人资金变动情况的电子账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d180a84c8f6a53a2219f766762578e2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="电子簿记账户">
  <data key="d0">电子簿记账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">电子簿记账户是用以记载债券投资人所持有债券品种、数量及其变动情况的电子账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8d180a84c8f6a53a2219f766762578e2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="定期存款账户">
  <data key="d0">定期存款账户</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">定期存款账户是用于存放定期存款的账户，管理人需与存款机构签订定期存款协议。&lt;SEP&gt;定期存款账户是用于存放委托资产投资定期存款的账户，管理人需与存款机构签订协议，并确保本息到期归还或提前支取的所有款项划至托管账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="银行间债券账户">
  <data key="d0">银行间债券账户</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">银行间债券账户是以定向资产管理计划名义在中央国债登记结算有限责任公司和银行间市场清算所股份有限公司开设的账户。&lt;SEP&gt;银行间债券账户是由资产托管人以定向资产管理计划名义在中央国债登记结算有限责任公司和银行间市场清算所股份有限公司开设的专户，用于债券和资金的清算。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="定向资产管理计划专用证券账户">
  <data key="d0">定向资产管理计划专用证券账户</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">定向资产管理计划专用证券账户由资产管理人负责开立、管理和使用，用于进行证券交易所的交易品种买卖。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="定向资产管理计划专用资金账户">
  <data key="d0">定向资产管理计划专用资金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">定向资产管理计划专用资金账户在证券公司清算模式下，由投资者开立并与托管账户建立三方存管关系，用于资金的管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="银行结算账户">
  <data key="d0">银行结算账户</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">银行结算账户在证券公司结算模式下，客户在托管人营业网点开立，并通过托管人的“第三方存管”平台与专用资金账户建立唯一对应关系，实现资产托管。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="单一资产管理业务">
  <data key="d0">单一资产管理业务</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">单一资产管理业务是一个长期开展的业务，涉及投资者定期或不定期地进行资产追加或提取，证券公司为客户提供持续的投资交易、资金结算、风险揭示等服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资产服务机构">
  <data key="d0">资产服务机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">资产服务机构是在资产支持计划存续期间，受托人聘请的负责对基础资产进行管理的机构，确保基础资产得到妥善管理，保障资产支持计划的顺利运作和受益人的权益。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="监管银行">
  <data key="d0">监管银行</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">监管银行是指负责托管资产管理计划资金的银行，按照监管要求对资金进行管理和监督。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中央国债登记结算有限责任公司">
  <data key="d0">中央国债登记结算有限责任公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中央国债登记结算有限责任公司是负责银行间债券账户开设和清算的机构。&lt;SEP&gt;中央国债登记结算有限责任公司负责为证券公司开立债券托管帐户，并与结算系统联网。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73108d0147d361b782facf1917eeaa00</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="银行间市场清算所股份有限公司">
  <data key="d0">银行间市场清算所股份有限公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">银行间市场清算所股份有限公司是负责银行间债券账户开设和清算的机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="北京证券交易所">
  <data key="d0">北京证券交易所</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">北京证券交易所是证券交易所之一，负责对上市保荐书内容作出具体规定，对发行人申请文件进行核查，并进行自律管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="上海证券交易所">
  <data key="d0">上海证券交易所</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">上海证券交易所是证券交易所之一，负责对上市保荐书内容作出具体规定，对发行人申请文件进行核查，并进行自律管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="深圳证券交易所">
  <data key="d0">深圳证券交易所</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">深圳证券交易所是证券交易所之一，负责对上市保荐书内容作出具体规定，对发行人申请文件进行核查，并进行自律管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="上市申请">
  <data key="d0">上市申请</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">上市申请是拟上市公司向证券交易所提交的正式申请文件，包含公司基本信息、财务状况、业务计划等内容。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券发行上市保荐业务管理办法">
  <data key="d0">证券发行上市保荐业务管理办法</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">《证券发行上市保荐业务管理办法》是中国证券监督管理委员会制定和修订的管理办法，用于规范证券发行上市保荐业务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="辅导协议">
  <data key="d0">辅导协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">辅导协议是证券公司与拟上市公司之间签订的协议，明确双方在发行前辅导过程中的权利和义务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Issuer (Prospective Listed Company)">
  <data key="d0">Issuer (Prospective Listed Company)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The issuer is the prospective listed company responsible for providing detailed information and documents to meet regulatory requirements, ensuring the authenticity, accuracy, and completeness of information disclosure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Underwriting Syndicate">
  <data key="d0">Underwriting Syndicate</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The underwriting syndicate is a team of multiple securities companies that collectively undertake the responsibility of underwriting and distributing new shares, with the lead underwriter playing a key role.&lt;SEP&gt;A group of underwriters, including the lead underwriter, that work together to manage the roadshow, price the stock, and allocate shares to investors.&lt;SEP&gt;The underwriting syndicate is responsible for market promotion activities, risk assessment and management, and ensuring the compliance and security of fund settlement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7dbd2fb9dfe4697cc441ad5c5d230e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Audit Firm">
  <data key="d0">Audit Firm</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An audit firm, typically an accounting firm, is responsible for auditing the financial statements of the prospective listed company to ensure the authenticity, accuracy, and completeness of financial information.&lt;SEP&gt;The Audit Firm conducts audits and provides verification reports to ensure the issuer's capital is in place.&lt;SEP&gt;An audit firm, typically an accounting firm, conducts financial audits and due diligence to evaluate the target company's financial condition and business prospects.&lt;SEP&gt;The audit firm is responsible for conducting independent audits of the financial statements of companies applying for listing, ensuring the accuracy and compliance with accounting standards, and providing professional opinions to enhance investor confidence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7dbd2fb9dfe4697cc441ad5c5d230e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Advisor">
  <data key="d0">Legal Advisor</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A legal advisor ensures that the company complies with relevant laws and regulations during the IPO process, drafts and reviews legal documents, and handles regulatory requirements and disputes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legal Advisor ensures that the issuer complies with all relevant laws and regulations, drafts and reviews legal documents, and provides professional advice on risk management and regulatory compliance. They also participate in the design of transaction structures, protect investor rights, and provide dispute resolution services when necessary.&lt;SEP&gt;Legal advisors provide comprehensive legal services and support to listed companies, including due diligence, drafting key legal documents, and offering professional legal advice on listing conditions and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Legal Advisor conducts legal compliance reviews to ensure all legal documents meet regulatory requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad7dbd2fb9dfe4697cc441ad5c5d230e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Market Promotion">
  <data key="d0">Market Promotion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Market promotion includes activities such as roadshows and investor meetings, aimed at increasing the visibility and attractiveness of the company to potential investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068928</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Roadshow">
  <data key="d0">Roadshow</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A roadshow is an event where the company and its underwriters present the company's business and growth prospects to potential investors, often held in multiple locations.&lt;SEP&gt;A series of presentations and meetings where the company and underwriters introduce the IPO to potential investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regulatory Compliance">
  <data key="d0">Regulatory Compliance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Regulatory compliance involves ensuring that the company adheres to all relevant laws and regulations during the IPO process, including financial reporting and corporate governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory compliance ensures that the merger or acquisition process adheres to all relevant laws, regulations, and standards set by regulatory authorities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Xu Mou">
  <data key="d0">Xu Mou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Xu Mou bribed Ma Moujun with 1 million RMB, which was used to invest in financial products.&lt;SEP&gt;Xu Mou is an individual who bribed Ma Moujun with 1 million RMB, which was later used to invest in financial products.&lt;SEP&gt;Xu Mou, an employee of Li Accounting Firm, signed the audit report without participating in the on-site audit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zhao Mou">
  <data key="d0">Zhao Mou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhao Mou bribed Ma Moujun with 80,000 USD, which was later deposited into a bank account.&lt;SEP&gt;Zhao Mou is an individual who bribed Ma Moujun with 80,000 USD in cash.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="State-Owned Petrochemical Company">
  <data key="d0">State-Owned Petrochemical Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The State-Owned Petrochemical Company is where Ma Moujun worked and facilitated contracts with other companies in exchange for bribes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial Products">
  <data key="d0">Financial Products</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Financial products are investment vehicles used by Ma Moujun and his brother to launder bribe money.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Equity Funds">
  <data key="d0">Private Equity Funds</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Private equity funds are investment products with higher entry barriers and less liquidity, making them less attractive for money laundering compared to public mutual funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Public Mutual Funds">
  <data key="d0">Public Mutual Funds</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Public mutual funds are investment products that are more liquid and have lower entry barriers, making them more attractive for money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ma Moujun's Brother">
  <data key="d0">Ma Moujun's Brother</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ma Moujun's brother received and managed the funds from Ma Moujun's investments, including 1.09 million RMB and 80,000 USD, and used them for further investments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (China Settlement)">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (China Settlement)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">China Settlement is a core infrastructure and service institution in the Chinese securities market, primarily responsible for securities registration, settlement, and clearing. As the only central securities depository and clearing institution in the country, it handles the registration, custody, and post-trade clearing and settlement of various securities including stocks, bonds, and funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Customer Fund Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Customer Fund Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Customer Fund Settlement Account is an account opened by the securities company at China Settlement to hold funds for end-of-day settlement, ensuring sufficient liquidity for the clearance and settlement of public fund transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Securities settlement accounts are opened by securities companies at China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation to hold securities for settlement.&lt;SEP&gt;The Securities Settlement Account is an account opened by the securities company at China Settlement to record securities holdings and facilitate securities settlement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Customer Settlement Margin Account">
  <data key="d0">Customer Settlement Margin Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Customer Settlement Margin Account is an account opened by the securities company at China Settlement to provide credit support and risk management for public fund transactions, ensuring that both parties can fulfill their settlement obligations and comply with regulatory requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Custody Account">
  <data key="d0">Custody Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The custody account holds the funds and ensures they are directed to the appropriate investment targets.&lt;SEP&gt;A custody account is used to safeguard and regulate the assets of investors, ensuring compliance and asset safety, and separating client assets from the operational funds of the investment advisory institution.&lt;SEP&gt;The Custody Account is a dedicated deposit account opened by the securities company at a commercial bank to hold the fund's assets.&lt;SEP&gt;The Custody Account is managed by the custodian to securely hold the fund's assets, ensuring the compliance of fund operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce36971547dce4e14d361ad14139277e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Sales Settlement Dedicated Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Sales Settlement Dedicated Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An account opened by a fund sales institution at a commercial bank or China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation for the aggregation, temporary storage, and transfer of funds during the fund sales process.&lt;SEP&gt;The Fund Sales Settlement Dedicated Account is used to collect, temporarily store, and transfer funds for fund sales settlements, ensuring the safe, efficient, and transparent flow of subscription and redemption funds between investors and the fund's asset custody account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-90c55f1d93271de993bd9be5aa89d41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="私募基金管理人">
  <data key="d0">私募基金管理人</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">私募基金管理人是负责管理和销售私募基金产品的机构，需在证券基金业协会登记备案。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-799b9c061447eeff077ab1d44fb1a678</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券基金业协会">
  <data key="d0">证券基金业协会</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">证券基金业协会是负责监管私募基金管理人及其产品登记备案的机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="收益凭证">
  <data key="d0">收益凭证</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">收益凭证是证券公司依法发行的一种有价证券，约定本金和收益的偿付与特定标的相关联，主要用于补充发行人营运资金。&lt;SEP&gt;收益凭证是一种金融产品，可以是固定收益或浮动收益类型，由证券公司发行并支付给投资者收益。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券公司柜台市场">
  <data key="d0">证券公司柜台市场</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">证券公司柜台市场是收益凭证发行和交易的场所之一，用于非公开发行收益凭证。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机构间私募产品报价与服务系统">
  <data key="d0">机构间私募产品报价与服务系统</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">机构间私募产品报价与服务系统是收益凭证发行和交易的另一个场所，用于非公开发行收益凭证。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="客户资金账户">
  <data key="d0">客户资金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">客户资金账户是投资者在证券公司开立的用于购买收益凭证的基本账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bb1773943947a823a034e5645af9bcf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资产管理计划">
  <data key="d0">资产管理计划</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">资产管理计划是一种金融产品，投资者可能通过复杂的交易方式将其用于洗钱。&lt;SEP&gt;资产管理计划是证券公司为客户管理资产的一种方式，包括股票质押业务和分级资产管理计划等。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b9fd1ba6198f582f9c13ba82c43f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券经纪账户">
  <data key="d0">证券经纪账户</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">证券经纪账户是投资者在证券公司开立的账户，用于进行证券交易。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点5">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点5</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点5涉及公募基金产品缺乏明确的投资安排、风险收益特征和风险管控措施，存在欺诈投资者的风险。&lt;SEP&gt;股份代持指股票的实际控制人将股票托管在第三人名下，从表面无法发现该股票的实际控制人，代持背后隐藏的证券犯罪和洗钱风险尤为突出。&lt;SEP&gt;洗钱风险点5涉及利用资产管理计划与股票质押业务的关系，通过自身或关联公司清洗非法资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点6">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点6</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点6涉及业务人员可能通过夸大宣传产品收益，诱骗投资者购买，以诈骗客户财产。&lt;SEP&gt;IPO配售环节可能存在清洗非法资金的风险，网下投资者可以参与网下配售，如配售对象将非法资金参与配售，再将获配股票出售，将达到洗白非法资金的目的。&lt;SEP&gt;洗钱风险点6涉及证券公司通过高比例杠杆设计获取高额收益，发行分级资产管理计划，使得劣后级份额持有人获得高额收益，实施不当利益输送。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点7">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点7</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">项目组人员可能向他人泄露证券发行内幕信息，间接协助他人进行内幕交易，或直接实际控制他人账户进行内幕交易。&lt;SEP&gt;洗钱风险点7涉及资产管理计划投资经理等关键人员在利益驱使下，违背职业信条，利用职务之便获取内幕信息谋取个人私利。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点8">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点8</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点8涉及资产管理计划投资经理等关键人员利用资管账户的资金优势，参与拉抬打压、虚假申报等操纵市场行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点9">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点9</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点9涉及资产管理计划投资经理等关键人员利用委托资产进行关联人融资等场外非标产品的违规交易，存在利益输送、证券欺诈等风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-db43f29f74c230b4dbaa70b6e70c2513</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="全国股转系统">
  <data key="d0">全国股转系统</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">全国股转系统是负责确认做市商成交申报的机构，对证券代码、申报价格和数量等进行匹配。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f49f073a32a9b70da3ff66d5b316f66</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="做市商">
  <data key="d0">做市商</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">做市商在新三板市场中通过双边报价为挂牌公司的股票提供市场流动性和价格发现支持。&lt;SEP&gt;做市商是指在证券交易中提供买卖报价并按指定价格和数量与对手方成交的金融机构。&lt;SEP&gt;做市商是提供买卖报价以增强市场流动性的机构，通过买卖价差获利。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f49f073a32a9b70da3ff66d5b316f66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a29debdd1f08d30ff95d3c8efca8dcd2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="股份转让系统">
  <data key="d0">股份转让系统</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">股份转让系统对做市商的做市业务进行持续监管，并要求做市商定期报告相关情况。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f49f073a32a9b70da3ff66d5b316f66</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
