<node id="Fund Company">
  <data key="d0">Fund Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The fund company confirms the information about fund shares and provides feedback to the securities company.&lt;SEP&gt;Fund companies and their subsidiaries are part of the institutions covered, providing investment advisory services and managing fund accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
