  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investment Management And Operation Stage">
  <data key="d0">Investment Management And Operation Stage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">This stage involves the collection of sales fees, investment of raised funds, and the calculation of returns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068929</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Regulatory Commission (CsRC)">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Regulatory Commission (CsRC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CSRC is the regulatory body that sets rules and regulations for the financial industry.&lt;SEP&gt;The China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) is the regulatory body that receives annual custody reports from the securities company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce36971547dce4e14d361ad14139277e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stocks And Bonds">
  <data key="d0">Stocks And Bonds</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Funds are invested in stocks and bonds as per the fund contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Depository Bank Account">
  <data key="d0">Depository Bank Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The depository bank account receives the funds from the custody account for investment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Redemption Stage">
  <data key="d0">Redemption Stage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">This stage involves the process of investors redeeming their fund shares and the transfer of funds back to the investor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Public Mutual Fund Distribution Business">
  <data key="d0">Public Mutual Fund Distribution Business</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The business of distributing public mutual funds, which can be used to launder illegal funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Transaction Transfer">
  <data key="d0">Non-Transaction Transfer</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A method of transferring fund assets through false inheritance or gift procedures to launder illegal gains.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Registration Agent">
  <data key="d0">Registration Agent</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The registration agent is involved in the processing of redemption requests and the transfer of funds to the securities company's dedicated account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regional Equity Market">
  <data key="d0">Regional Equity Market</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Regional Equity Market is a platform where companies can list and raise funds, but it has potential money laundering risks such as illegal fundraising and unclear sources of funds.&lt;SEP&gt;The Regional Equity Market is a financial market where regional companies can list and trade their shares, but it does not directly interact with investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f88db09cf8ffc393a8809d56be486363</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Employees">
  <data key="d0">Employees</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Employees are individuals working for the company who may be involved in insider trading or other unethical practices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Large Collective Asset Management Business">
  <data key="d0">Large Collective Asset Management Business</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Large Collective Asset Management Business refers to the management of large-scale collective asset management plans with more than 200 investors, which is no longer allowed under current regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Small Collective Asset Management Business">
  <data key="d0">Small Collective Asset Management Business</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Small Collective Asset management Business refers to the management of small-scale collective asset management plans with between 2 and 200 qualified investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Client Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Client Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Client Fund Account is a record-keeping account that tracks the client's holdings and transactions in a fund managed by the fund manager.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Client Capital Account">
  <data key="d0">Client Capital Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Client Capital Account is a bank account opened at a designated commercial bank for the purpose of transferring and settling funds related to the collective asset management plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Account for Collective Asset Management Plan Fundraising and Settlement">
  <data key="d0">Special Account for Collective Asset Management Plan Fundraising and Settlement</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">This account is used by the asset manager to manage the bank deposits of the collective asset management plan and handle all monetary transactions related to the plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Capital Account for Collective Asset Management Plan">
  <data key="d0">Special Capital Account for Collective Asset Management Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Special Capital Account for the Collective Asset Management Plan is a dedicated bank account used to manage the financial transactions and store the bank deposits of the plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Securities Account for Collective Asset Management Plan">
  <data key="d0">Special Securities Account for Collective Asset Management Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Special Securities Account for the Collective Asset Management Plan is a dedicated securities account used to conduct the business of the asset management plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Settlement Account for Collective Asset Management Plan Funds">
  <data key="d0">Settlement Account for Collective Asset Management Plan Funds</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Settlement Account for Collective Asset Management Plan Funds is a dedicated account used to handle the settlement of securities transactions for the plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bond Custody Account">
  <data key="d0">Bond Custody Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Bond Custody Account is a dedicated account used to hold and manage bonds and related financial transactions for the asset management plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Open-Ended Securities Investment Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Open-Ended Securities Investment Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An Open-Ended Securities Investment Fund Account is a dedicated account used to manage the fund's transactions and receive redemption and dividend payments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bank Account for Time Deposits">
  <data key="d0">Bank Account for Time Deposits</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A Bank Account for Time Deposits is a dedicated account used to manage time deposits and related interest payments for the asset management plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Qualified Investors">
  <data key="d0">Qualified Investors</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Qualified Investors are individuals or entities that meet specific financial criteria and are allowed to invest in small collective asset management plans.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d37b73fa36c3f49ecded1a278d97eeaf</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="融出方">
  <data key="d0">融出方</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The融出方includes securities companies, collective asset management plans or directed asset management clients managed by securities companies, and collective asset management plans or directed asset management clients managed by asset management subsidiaries of securities companies. The融出方bears the financial risk of the pledged loan and recovers funds by disposing of the pledged stocks if the融入方defaults.&lt;SEP&gt;融出方是提供资金的一方，当为资产管理计划时，可能存在投资者利用复杂交易方式进行洗钱的风险。&lt;SEP&gt;融出方是提供资金的一方，在资产管理计划中可能是投资者。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b9fd1ba6198f582f9c13ba82c43f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77b36439da8f8202fe97a3d1f6b5a70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="融入方">
  <data key="d0">融入方</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The融入方accepts stock pledge services provided by the securities company, uses the pledged stocks to obtain funds, and repurchases the pledged stocks at the end of the repurchase period to repay the borrowed funds. According to the "Stock Pledge Repurchase Transaction and Registration Settlement Business Measures (Revised 2018)," the融入方cannot be a financial institution or other organizations engaged in lending, private equity investment, or personal lending, except for certain venture capital funds and specific conditions for directed asset management.&lt;SEP&gt;融入方是申请股票质押业务的个人或实体，可能提供虚假身份信息、非法控制他人账户、使用非法资金或进行洗钱活动。&lt;SEP&gt;融入方是参与股票质押回购业务的客户，可能通过频繁提前偿还资金进行洗钱。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b9fd1ba6198f582f9c13ba82c43f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77b36439da8f8202fe97a3d1f6b5a70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="融入方Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">融入方Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">An account opened with a securities company that holds the securities to be pledged. The securities are registered as pledged until the融入方repurchases them and repays the borrowed funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="融入方Dedicated Funding Account">
  <data key="d0">融入方Dedicated Funding Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A dedicated account opened by the融入方at a designated commercial bank, used to hold the funds obtained from the stock pledge repurchase or the funds to be repaid.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="融出方Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">融出方Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">An account opened by the融出方with the securities company. After the stock pledge registration, the pledged securities are recorded under this account. Depending on the type of融出方, it can be a proprietary securities account of the securities company or a dedicated securities account for the asset management plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="融出方Funds Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">融出方Funds Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">An account opened by the融出方at a bank for the transfer of funds. Depending on the type of融出方, it can be a proprietary non-guaranteed funds settlement account of the securities company, a custodian institution's non-gurnished funds settlement account, or a client non-guaranteed funds settlement account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shanghai and Shenzhen Stock Exchanges">
  <data key="d0">Shanghai and Shenzhen Stock Exchanges</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Shanghai and Shenzhen Stock Exchanges are the primary stock exchanges in China where A-shares and other approved securities are listed and traded.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A-Shares">
  <data key="d0">A-Shares</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A-shares are stocks of Chinese companies that are listed on the Shanghai and Shenzhen Stock Exchanges and are generally available for trading by domestic and some foreign investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stock Pledge Repurchase Transaction">
  <data key="d0">Stock Pledge Repurchase Transaction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A stock pledge repurchase transaction is a financial method where the融入方uses their held securities as collateral to obtain funds, and the融出方provides the funds with the pledged securities as security.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Repurchase Period">
  <data key="d0">Repurchase Period</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The repurchase period is the duration of the stock pledge repurchase transaction, which, according to the regulations of the Shanghai and Shenzhen Stock Exchanges, cannot exceed 3 years.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0424814bed48c5baa8bff4f3020af478</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资产管理投资顾问业务">
  <data key="d0">资产管理投资顾问业务</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">资产管理投资顾问业务是指证券公司接受资产管理产品管理人或其他金融机构的委托，为其依法设立、在境内外发行的各类金融产品提供投资建议、资产配置、投资策略和研究咨询等专业服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2404bdb1079eb96c5a6fee04a45a653</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资管产品管理人">
  <data key="d0">资管产品管理人</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">资管产品管理人是成立、运作和管理资管产品的金融机构，接受证券公司提供的投资顾问服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2404bdb1079eb96c5a6fee04a45a653</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="投资顾问协议">
  <data key="d0">投资顾问协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">投资顾问协议是证券公司与资管产品管理人之间签订的合同，明确双方的权利和义务，规范双方在投资咨询、资产管理运作、风险控制、信息披露等方面的具体行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c2404bdb1079eb96c5a6fee04a45a653</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="美国证券交易委员会">
