<node id="Non-Public Offering Stock Discount Price">
  <data key="d0">Non-Public Offering Stock Discount Price</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The non-public offering stock discount price refers to the discounted price at which non-publicly traded stocks are offered, and it is subject to regulations that prohibit short selling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Customer Due Diligence">
  <data key="d0">Customer Due Diligence</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Customer due diligence involves understanding the customer's purpose for participating in securities lending and checking for potential conflicts of interest or arbitrage activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Customer Due Diligence involves verifying the identity and background of clients, including their business purposes and transaction intentions, to prevent money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Anti-Money Laundering (AML) Screening">
  <data key="d0">Anti-Money Laundering (AML) Screening</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">AML screening involves checking investors against AML lists and reviewing their records for any significant violations related to securities trading within the past three years.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Lending">
  <data key="d0">Securities Lending</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Securities lending is a process where securities are temporarily transferred to another party, and it can be used to launder the nature and source of illegally obtained securities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A fund account is opened by investors at securities companies to record their holdings of public fund products.&lt;SEP&gt;A fund account is an account opened by the client at the securities company to facilitate investment in funds and related advisory services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cash Account">
  <data key="d0">Cash Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A cash account is opened by investors at securities companies to manage and store their cash funds.&lt;SEP&gt;Cash Account is an account opened by investors at securities companies to store and manage their cash funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="TA Account">
  <data key="d0">TA Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A TA account is opened by investors at securities companies to separately record their holdings of different fund managers' products.&lt;SEP&gt;TA Account is an account opened by investors based on the different fund managers they purchase from, used to separately record the fund products held under different fund managers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Sales Settlement Special Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Sales Settlement Special Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A special account opened by securities companies at commercial banks for the aggregation, temporary storage, and transfer of funds during the fund sales process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clearing Funds Account">
  <data key="d0">Clearing Funds Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A clearing funds account is established by the fund manager or its designated registration agent to collect and clear investor subscription funds from various channels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Custody Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Custody Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">A dedicated account set up by the custodian institution for the safekeeping and management of the fund's assets.&lt;SEP&gt;Fund Custody Account is a dedicated account established by the custodian institution for the safekeeping and management of the fund's assets.&lt;SEP&gt;Fund Custody Account is a dedicated account used to hold and manage the funds of investors, and is monitored for suspicious transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f20cf2fe10377b786920fe0fc0becd6f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Investor Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Investor Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Investor Securities Account is used by investors to conduct securities transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;An investor securities account is used by investors to conduct transactions such as subscribing, trading, purchasing, and redeeming ETFs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Proprietary Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Proprietary Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Proprietary Settlement Account is used by market makers to settle their market-making transactions without opening a separate market-making settlement account. It serves as a bridge for fund flow between the market maker and China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited, ensuring the security and efficiency of transaction settlements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="New Third Board Market Making Service">
  <data key="d0">New Third Board Market Making Service</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The New Third Board Market Making Service is a continuous business rather than a one-time operation. Market makers continuously provide buy and sell quotes, providing liquidity and price support for listed companies' stocks. This service is crucial for market liquidity, price discovery, and stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Counterparty (Investors and Other Market Makers)">
  <data key="d0">Counterparty (Investors and Other Market Makers)</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Counterparties, including investors and other market makers, are key participants in the New Third Board market. Investors are divided into individual and institutional investors (such as securities investment funds, trust companies, asset management companies, and insurance companies). They submit orders based on the buy and sell quotes provided by market makers. The trading activities of investors influence market liquidity and price fluctuations and provide necessary capital support to listed companies. Market makers transfer stocks among themselves to adjust inventory, using a confirmation method for transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="National Equities Exchange and Quotations System">
  <data key="d0">National Equities Exchange and Quotations System</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The National Equities Exchange and Quotations System is the trading platform provider for the New Third Board market. It formulates and enforces market-making rules, supervises market maker behavior, enhances market liquidity and financing functions, and promotes the financing and development of small and medium-sized enterprises. Its activities include processing investor buy and sell orders and matching them with market maker quotes based on price and time priority.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The organization responsible for handling the settlement and clearing of funds for the online and offline issuance of new shares.&lt;SEP&gt;The China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited (CSDC) provides settlement data for the Securities Company to complete the primary clearance.&lt;SEP&gt;China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited provides centralized registration, custody, and settlement services for securities transactions in the New Third Board market. It manages the instructions for transferring inventory stocks held by market makers and standardizes cross-market re-registration for listed securities, ensuring smooth fund clearing and share transfers, and protecting the legitimate rights and interests of both parties in transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited is the institution that manages settlement and clearing processes, ensuring the timely and accurate completion of transactions and the safe transfer of funds and securities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4ebe33e5007740c7c37824249e8b0053&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Target Company">
  <data key="d0">Target Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The target company is the business being acquired, and its financial, operational, and legal compliance are thoroughly investigated.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Buyer">
  <data key="d0">Buyer</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The buyer is the entity acquiring the target company, and it assesses the strategic and commercial feasibility of the transaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial Advisor">
  <data key="d0">Financial Advisor</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Financial advisors provide comprehensive services including due diligence, valuation, negotiation support, and transaction structuring to ensure a successful merger or acquisition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Independent Financial Advisor">
  <data key="d0">Independent Financial Advisor</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An independent financial advisor is a professional institution hired by listed companies or their independent directors to provide specialized services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Counsel">
  <data key="d0">Legal Counsel</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal counsel ensures that the merger and acquisition process complies with relevant laws and regulations, drafts and reviews legal documents, and provides risk management and dispute resolution services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regulatory Authority (China Securities Regulatory Commission)">
  <data key="d0">Regulatory Authority (China Securities Regulatory Commission)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) makes decisions on registration applications based on the stock exchange's review and can request additional information or re-evaluation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Client Recognition">
  <data key="d0">Client Recognition</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Client recognition refers to the process of identifying and formalizing the relationship between a securities firm and a client, such as a listed company, through a financial advisory agreement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Information/Funding Flow">
  <data key="d0">Information/Funding Flow</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The information/funding flow describes the sequence of steps and interactions in the preparation, due diligence, and negotiation stages of a merger or acquisition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Business Plan">
  <data key="d0">Business Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The business plan is a document prepared by the listed company, outlining the strategic and operational details of the merger or acquisition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financial Statements">
  <data key="d0">Financial Statements</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Documents that provide a detailed overview of the company's financial performance and position.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial statements are documents that provide detailed financial information about the listed company, used for due diligence and valuation purposes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Legal Documents">
  <data key="d0">Legal Documents</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Legal documents are prepared by the listed company and reviewed by legal counsel to ensure compliance with relevant laws and regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transaction Valuation">
  <data key="d0">Transaction Valuation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Transaction valuation is the process of determining the fair value of the target company using various valuation methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Payment Method">
  <data key="d0">Payment Method</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Payment method refers to the way in which the buyer will pay for the target company, such as cash, shares, or a combination of both.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Financing Arrangement">
  <data key="d0">Financing Arrangement</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Financing arrangement involves the planning and securing of funds needed to complete the transaction, including debt and equity financing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tax Planning">
  <data key="d0">Tax Planning</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Tax planning is the process of structuring the transaction to optimize the tax implications for the buyer and the target company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Synergy Assessment">
  <data key="d0">Synergy Assessment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Synergy assessment evaluates the potential benefits and cost savings that can be achieved by combining the operations of the buyer and the target company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integration Plan">
  <data key="d0">Integration Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Integration plan outlines the steps and strategies for successfully integrating the target company into the buyer's operations after the transaction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-57fefcbad67cefd72d96f497f024296e</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="北登中心">
  <data key="d0">北登中心</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">北登中心是北京市唯一经市政府批准设立的权益登记托管平台，负责北京市非上市股份公司股份登记托管职能等。&lt;SEP&gt;北登中心是投资者开立证券账户并进行股票买卖的地方。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="河北TL房地产开发股份公司">
  <data key="d0">河北TL房地产开发股份公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">河北TL房地产开发股份公司是一家涉嫌非法集资的公司，通过虚假宣传和承诺高额收益向不特定对象推销“优先股”。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="重庆股转中心">
  <data key="d0">重庆股转中心</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">重庆股转中心是河北TL房地产开发股份公司获得挂牌备案确认函的地方。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="陕西证监局">
  <data key="d0">陕西证监局</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">陕西证监局是发现河北TL房地产开发股份公司涉嫌非法集资并进行质询的监管机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="上海HCF股权投资管理有限公司">
  <data key="d0">上海HCF股权投资管理有限公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">上海HCF股权投资管理有限公司是一家中介机构，推荐陕西XLXM有限责任公司在上海股权托管交易中心挂牌，并主导了上市答谢会。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="陕西XLXM有限责任公司">
  <data key="d0">陕西XLXM有限责任公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">陕西XLXM有限责任公司是一家通过中介机构在上海股权托管交易中心挂牌，并公开推销所谓“原始股权”的公司。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1afa5175cddfc3e886c401054b4c39a4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
