<node id="Initial Public Offering (IPO)">
  <data key="d0">Initial Public Offering (IPO)</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Initial Public Offering (IPO) is the process by which a private company raises capital by selling shares to the public.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b76cb9d596e1bbda44d3d73e725e1c9c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Science and Technology Innovation Board (STAR Market)">
  <data key="d0">Science and Technology Innovation Board (STAR Market)</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Science and Technology Innovation Board, also known as the STAR Market, is the specific segment of the Shanghai Stock Exchange where Shanghai Sierxin Technology applied for listing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b76cb9d596e1bbda44d3d73e725e1c9c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Issuer">
  <data key="d0">Issuer</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Issuer is the entity that issues bonds and receives services from the securities company, including financial advisory and underwriting services.&lt;SEP&gt;The Issuer is the entity that issues bonds and signs agreements with the lead underwriter.&lt;SEP&gt;The Issuer registers the bond, promotes the bond to potential investors, and uses the raised funds for business expansion, project development, and operational management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Issuer is an entity that may engage in fraudulent activities such as inflating revenue and hiding illegal funds to meet transaction conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sponsor Institution Project Team">
  <data key="d0">Sponsor Institution Project Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Sponsor Institution Project Team consists of individuals who may use undisclosed important information for insider trading or leak it to others.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Related Party">
  <data key="d0">Related Party</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Related Parties are entities that may be involved in improper transactions with the issuer, leading to the transfer of illegal funds or profit conveyance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stock Market">
  <data key="d0">Stock Market</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Stock Market is where the issuer may manipulate stock prices by controlling other accounts to buy large amounts of its own stock.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IPO Allocation">
  <data key="d0">IPO Allocation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IPO Allocation is a process where securities companies recommend investors to participate, which can be used to launder illegal funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nominee Shareholding">
  <data key="d0">Nominee Shareholding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Nominee Shareholding involves holding stocks under a third party's name, which may hide the actual controller and pose risks of financial crimes and money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Y公司">
  <data key="d0">Y公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Y公司是一家涉及资金违规操作的公司，最终在监管压力下退还了投资款并将合同文本归还给G公司。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="G公司">
  <data key="d0">G公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">G公司是与Y公司有合同关系的公司，Y公司在事件后将合同文本归还给了G公司。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中某中基集团">
  <data key="d0">中某中基集团</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中某中基集团及其法定代表人孟某、总经理岑某和已故副总经理庄某非法集资诈骗，通过多家空壳公司设计虚假私募基金产品，非法募集资金达78.81亿元。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="孟某">
  <data key="d0">孟某</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">孟某是中某中基集团的法定代表人，参与非法集资诈骗案，任意支配使用非法募集的资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
