  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="安徽安某控股">
  <data key="d0">安徽安某控股</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">安徽安某控股与北京统某投资基金管理有限公司签订协议，设立统某富邦并发行“富邦1号”私募基金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="统某富邦">
  <data key="d0">统某富邦</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">统某富邦是由北京统某投资基金管理有限公司与安徽安某控股设立的实体，发行“富邦1号”私募基金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="粮某集团">
  <data key="d0">粮某集团</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">粮某集团及其下属公司是“富邦1号”私募基金提供资金支持的对象。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="富邦1号">
  <data key="d0">富邦1号</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">“富邦1号”是统某富邦发行的私募基金，为粮某集团及其下属公司提供资金支持。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空壳公司">
  <data key="d0">空壳公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">空壳公司是由中某中基集团实际控制的多家公司，用于设计虚假私募基金产品和非法募集资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fae0751382baab9f46b90014f705c9a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="控股运营机构">
  <data key="d0">控股运营机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">控股运营机构是负责组织和运营区域性股权市场的机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中国证券登记结算有限公司">
  <data key="d0">中国证券登记结算有限公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中国证券登记结算有限公司与北登中心达成了战略合作，将北京区域性股权市场投资者账户体系纳入中国结算统一账户平台。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="会计师事务所">
  <data key="d0">会计师事务所</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">会计师事务所为上市公司提供审计服务并收取费用。&lt;SEP&gt;会计师事务所与推荐机构合作，对客户进行深入尽职调查，评估其财务健康状况。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d80138c6a3f72889165a0ac781f32ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="定向发行协议">
  <data key="d0">定向发行协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">《定向发行协议》是证券公司与申请挂牌公司签订的协议，明确发行的条款和条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="推荐挂牌服务协议">
  <data key="d0">推荐挂牌服务协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">推荐挂牌服务协议是推荐机构与挂牌企业签订的协议，用于提供推荐挂牌服务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068932</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="备案确认函">
  <data key="d0">备案确认函</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">备案确认函是北京股权交易中心在审查通过后出具的文件，申请挂牌公司需取得该函以办理挂牌手续。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3d0837e7534cd9a34d3631af7c3ce090</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lead Underwriter">
  <data key="d0">Lead Underwriter</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Lead Underwriter is responsible for overall coordination of the bond issuance, including pricing, organizing roadshows, and determining issuance terms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distributor">
  <data key="d0">Distributor</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Distributor assists in selling bonds to investors based on the distribution agreement with the lead underwriter.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Trustee Management Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Trustee Management Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Trustee Management Agreement is a contract between the issuer and the securities company, defining their rights and obligations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bond Issuance Financial Advisor Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Bond Issuance Financial Advisor Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Bond Issuance Financial Advisor Agreement is a contract between the issuer and the securities company, outlining their rights and obligations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rating Agency">
  <data key="d0">Rating Agency</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Rating Agency evaluates the issuer's credit status and provides credit ratings to help market participants understand the default risk, influencing investment decisions and financing costs. They continue to monitor the issuer's credit status post-issuance and notify the market of any significant changes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Rating Agency evaluates the creditworthiness of the issuer and provides a credit rating report.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distribution Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Distribution Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Distribution Agreement specifies the terms for distributors to participate in bond issuance, including the number of bonds, price, commission rate, and sales area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f07b36f52ee4a9ce5b004be2a76b530</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Fund Product">
  <data key="d0">Private Fund Product</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial product designed and managed by a fund manager, potentially with false information to defraud investors.&lt;SEP&gt;Private Fund Product is a financial product that can be designed with false content through forged financial data and trade contracts, and sold through unqualified companies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eba1461291c2875357e4bf638923de9</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Fund Industry Association">
  <data key="d0">Securities Fund Industry Association</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Securities Fund Industry Association is the regulatory body that registers and files private fund products and fund managers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Third-Party Database">
  <data key="d0">Third-Party Database</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A database used to screen for negative information about fund managers, including legal and credit issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Third-Party Database is used to screen for negative information about fund managers, including legal violations and dishonesty.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8eba1461291c2875357e4bf638923de9</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Key Business Personnel">
  <data key="d0">Key Business Personnel</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Key Business Personnel are individuals who, if bribed, may assist in illegal fundraising, financial fraud, and misappropriation of funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equity Investment">
  <data key="d0">Equity Investment</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Equity Investment is a type of investment where the securities company uses its own or legally raised funds to buy and sell equity assets, aiming for capital appreciation and dividend income.&lt;SEP&gt;Equity Investment is a continuous process where securities companies buy and sell securities based on market conditions and investment strategies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bd0a1a4b7684d1f5c307a33d9226d5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Proprietary Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Proprietary Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Proprietary Securities Account is a dedicated account used by the securities company to conduct securities transactions with its own or legally raised funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dedicated Deposit Account for Own Funds">
  <data key="d0">Dedicated Deposit Account for Own Funds</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Dedicated Deposit Account for Own Funds is an account opened by the securities company to allocate its own or legally raised funds according to regulations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Centralized Securities Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Centralized Securities Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Centralized Securities Settlement Account is a settlement account opened by the securities registration and settlement institution for handling multilateral settlement of securities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Centralized Fund Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Centralized Fund Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Centralized Fund Settlement Account is a settlement account opened by the securities registration and settlement institution for handling multilateral settlement of funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Company's Securities Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Company's Securities Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Securities Company's Securities Settlement Account is an account opened by the securities company with the securities registration and settlement institution for securities settlement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Company's Fund Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Company's Fund Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Securities Company's Fund Settlement Account is an account opened by the securities company with the securities registration and settlement institution for fund settlement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Illegal Fundraising and Financial Fraud">
  <data key="d0">Illegal Fundraising and Financial Fraud</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Illegal Fundraising and Financial Fraud refer to the activities where fund managers use products for illegal fundraising, financial fraud, and other criminal activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Negative News Screening">
  <data key="d0">Negative News Screening</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Negative News Screening is a process that involves regularly checking for negative news about fund managers, including legal violations and dishonesty, during the client relationship.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="上市公司控股股东">
  <data key="d0">上市公司控股股东</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">上市公司控股股东涉嫌资金占用，并可能涉及股份代持。&lt;SEP&gt;上市公司控股股东是指拥有公司主要控制权的股东。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="关联方">
  <data key="d0">关联方</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">关联方涉嫌资金占用。&lt;SEP&gt;关联方是指与公司有密切关系的个人或实体，可能包括客户、供应商等。&lt;SEP&gt;与发行人存在关联关系的实体，可能涉及关联交易。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="突击入股">
  <data key="d0">突击入股</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">掌握内幕消息或未公开消息的人士在拟上市公司股票首次公开发行的过程中以他人名义突击入股。&lt;SEP&gt;突击入股是指在公司上市前夕通过股权转让进行利益输送的行为。&lt;SEP&gt;突击入股是指掌握内幕消息或未公开消息的人士在新三板首次挂牌的过程中以他人名义突击入股拟挂牌公司，参与资金规模巨大，在公司挂牌后抛售股票，进行利益输送。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bde91f7dac51fd9740211f5769bf3ed</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="股份代持">
  <data key="d0">股份代持</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">股份代持即股票的实际控制人将股票托管在第三人名下，从表面无法发现该股票的实际控制人。&lt;SEP&gt;股份代持是指股票的实际控制人将股票托管在第三人名下的行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="网下配售">
  <data key="d0">网下配售</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">网下配售可能被用于清洗非法资金。&lt;SEP&gt;网下配售是指IPO过程中的一种配售方式，可能存在清洗非法资金的风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="保荐机构">
  <data key="d0">保荐机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">保荐机构可能被发行人收买，提供虚假保荐书。&lt;SEP&gt;保荐机构是协助企业进行上市申报的专业机构。&lt;SEP&gt;保荐机构负责对发行人进行辅导、尽职调查、制作立项材料，并与发行人签订《保荐协议》和《承销协议》。&lt;SEP&gt;保荐机构为上市公司的再融资项目提供保荐服务并收取费用。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d80138c6a3f72889165a0ac781f32ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1035ced4efc1ed82817b22721bf1107c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="从业人员">
  <data key="d0">从业人员</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">从业人员是指在拟上市公司改制辅导和保荐上市过程中利用职务便利进行利益输送的人员。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="白名单">
  <data key="d0">白名单</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">白名单是指符合资质条件的投资者名单。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="黑名单">
  <data key="d0">黑名单</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">黑名单是指过往存在异常情形的投资者名单。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="网下投资者">
  <data key="d0">网下投资者</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">网下投资者是指参与IPO网下配售的投资者，需要进行资金来源核查和资质筛查。&lt;SEP&gt;网下投资者是参与IPO配售环节的投资者，可能涉及清洗非法资金的风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6954c72593dea46dac1ae96bf0619d1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="标的证券">
  <data key="d0">标的证券</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">标的证券是融入方提供的作为担保物的证券，可能来源不合法或用于洗钱活动。&lt;SEP&gt;标的证券是指在增发前夕被大额买入的股票，可能存在异常交易行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-121b9fd1ba6198f582f9c13ba82c43f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="报价系统">
  <data key="d0">报价系统</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">报价系统是证券公司用于向合格投资者发行和销售收益凭证的渠道之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="柜台市场">
  <data key="d0">柜台市场</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">柜台市场是证券公司用于向合格投资者发行和销售收益凭证的渠道之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资金账户">
  <data key="d0">资金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">资金账户是投资者在证券公司开立的账户，用于认购资金的划转和管理。&lt;SEP&gt;资金账户是投资者在证券公司开立的账户，用于存放和管理投资者资金。&lt;SEP&gt;资金账户是投资者用于划付购买股票资金的账户，由个人或机构开立。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52b1f72cca6581350cf7ee13bfe210b0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="交易平台">
  <data key="d0">交易平台</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">交易平台是投资者进行收益凭证转让和交易的场所。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="张某某">
  <data key="d0">张某某</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">张某某是一名出纳员，利用职务之便挪用单位资金购买基金、证券等理财产品。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="安岳县某公司">
  <data key="d0">安岳县某公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">安岳县某公司是张某某担任出纳的公司，其资金被挪用。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工商局企业信用信息公示系统">
  <data key="d0">工商局企业信用信息公示系统</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">工商局企业信用信息公示系统是一个公开渠道，用于核查个体工商户和私营企业的信用信息。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="合格投资者">
  <data key="d0">合格投资者</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">合格投资者是指符合特定条件的投资者，可以参与收益凭证的发行和销售。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b5a998c3dce24dba67d05313bc63b558</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="起人及主要股东的身份信息/工商登记资料">
  <data key="d0">起人及主要股东的身份信息/工商登记资料</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">起人及主要股东的身份信息和工商登记资料，用于核实股东身份和公司注册信息。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="财务报表或审计报告">
  <data key="d0">财务报表或审计报告</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">最近一年及一期的财务报表或审计报告，用于评估公司的财务状况。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="媒体">
  <data key="d0">媒体</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">媒体可能被发行人利用来公布利好信息以维持股价。&lt;SEP&gt;媒体包括传统媒体、自媒体和新媒体，可能被用于散布虚假利好消息以操纵股价。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="财务造假">
  <data key="d0">财务造假</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">财务造假是指企业通过虚构业务、虚增收入等手段来掩盖实际经营状况的行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="股权代持">
  <data key="d0">股权代持</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">股权代持是指投资者通过他人名义持有股权，以隐藏实际控制人的身份。&lt;SEP&gt;股权代持是指投资者通过他人名义持有公司股份，以隐藏实际控制人的身份，可能被用来掩盖洗钱行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a9969ef83c079ee125525290bb6717f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bde91f7dac51fd9740211f5769bf3ed</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="券商部门">
  <data key="d0">券商部门</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">券商部门负责对衍生品经理人和拟销售、推介的衍生品进行审慎调查和风险评估。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="反洗钱信息报告专员">
  <data key="d0">反洗钱信息报告专员</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">反洗钱信息报告专员负责复核系统录入的可疑交易分析情况，并对可疑交易报告进行复核和补充。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="做市专用证券账户">
  <data key="d0">做市专用证券账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">做市专用证券账户用于记录做市商持有的股票和其他证券，是做市商进行买卖报价的核心账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="衍生品经理人">
  <data key="d0">衍生品经理人</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">衍生品经理人是负责管理和推销衍生品的人员，需要进行审慎调查和风险评估。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6e26bba0a201fb31a9f8fe64acc35a1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068933</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
