  <data key="d0">Shanghai Hcf</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Shanghai HCF is an intermediary that engaged in illegal public transfer of shares, provided misleading information, and collected "consultation fees" after share transfers.</data>
