  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可疑交易监测系统">
  <data key="d0">可疑交易监测系统</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">设计系统规则监测增发前夕大额买入标的证券股票的异常交易行为，分析账户实际控制人是否与标的证券存在关联关系。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="项目组人员">
  <data key="d0">项目组人员</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">项目组人员可能向他人泄露证券发行内幕信息，间接协助他人进行内幕交易，或直接实际控制他人账户进行内幕交易。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ea785fd26c1e89c5502e434af0cbe01</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Warehouse Receipt Trading">
  <data key="d0">Warehouse Receipt Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Warehouse receipt trading involves the purchase of physical goods and their conversion into standard warehouse receipts, which can be sold on the futures market to obtain cash and hide the source of funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Account Manipulation">
  <data key="d0">Account Manipulation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Account manipulation involves the use of multiple accounts to conduct joint trades, knock trades, or other fraudulent activities to manipulate the market and profit illegally.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Settlement Business">
  <data key="d0">Settlement Business</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Settlement business involves the execution, clearing, and delivery of securities and funds in public fund transactions, ensuring accurate and timely completion of trades.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Futures Account">
  <data key="d0">Futures Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Futures accounts are used by investors for trading and can be manipulated for illegal activities such as money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Product Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Product Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Fund product securities accounts are opened by securities companies to record the types and quantities of securities held by fund products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Product Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Product Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Fund product fund accounts are established by securities companies to manage the funds for securities transactions, linked to bank custodial accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Client Fund Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Client Fund Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Client fund settlement accounts are opened by securities companies at China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation to hold funds for daily settlement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="商业计划书">
  <data key="d0">商业计划书</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">商业计划书是保荐机构对上市公司高层进行辅导和项目初步调研的必要材料之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="法律文件">
  <data key="d0">法律文件</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">法律文件是保荐机构对上市公司高层进行辅导和项目初步调研的必要材料之一，由审计机构和法律顾问审核。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="配股">
  <data key="d0">配股</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">配股是向股权登记日在册的股东按相同比例配售股票的一种发行方式。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可转债">
  <data key="d0">可转债</data>
  <data key="d1">financialinstrument</data>
  <data key="d2">可转债是一种可以在一定条件下转换为公司股票的债券，其转股价格和利率由上市公司与主承销商协商确定。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55b0cb0fe08d7392e68c77df84f2c064</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr.">
  <data key="d0">Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr. is a 25-year-old individual from Seffner, Florida, accused of conducting a fraudulent "free-riding" scheme by using fake brokerage accounts and false bank deposits to obtain credit from broker-dealers.&lt;SEP&gt;Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr. is a 25-year-old individual from Seffner, Florida, who was charged by the SEC for conducting a fraudulent "free-riding" scheme.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb11b0587a7113559ef65ba6e8e5d02</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Syed Arham Arbab">
  <data key="d0">Syed Arham Arbab</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Syed Arham Arbab is a 25-year-old individual who, along with five others, used empty or underfunded bank accounts to make over $2 million in false deposits into various brokerage accounts to deceive broker-dealers into providing instant deposit credit for online securities trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC)">
  <data key="d0">U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) is the regulatory body that charged Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr. and Syed Arham Arbab with fraudulent activities related to "free-riding" schemes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Seffner, Florida">
  <data key="d0">Seffner, Florida</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Seffner, Florida is the city where Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr. resides and from which he conducted his fraudulent activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Broker-Dealers">
  <data key="d0">Broker-Dealers</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Broker-Dealers are financial institutions that provided credit to Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr. and Syed Arham Arbab based on false information and were defrauded as a result.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Instant Deposit Credit">
  <data key="d0">Instant Deposit Credit</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Instant Deposit Credit is a type of credit provided by broker-dealers to allow immediate trading, which was fraudulently obtained by Syed Arham Arbab and his associates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Trading">
  <data key="d0">Securities Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Securities Trading refers to the buying and selling of financial instruments, which was the primary activity in the fraudulent schemes conducted by Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr. and Syed Arham Arbab.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fraudulent Deposits">
  <data key="d0">Fraudulent Deposits</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Fraudulent Deposits are false or fake deposits made into brokerage accounts to deceive broker-dealers into providing instant deposit credit, as done by Syed Arham Arbab and his associates.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Brokerage Accounts">
  <data key="d0">Brokerage Accounts</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Brokerage Accounts are financial accounts used for securities trading, which were fraudulently opened and used by Tyrone Johnny Lacy, Jr. and Syed Arham Arbab.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bf18b17d4862a8e9b1ceef087d7c0ca</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金账户">
  <data key="d0">基金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">基金账户是指用于管理和记录基金交易的账户，存在赎回完成后注销的行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="公募基金代销客户">
  <data key="d0">公募基金代销客户</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">公募基金代销客户是指通过网上开户后短期内申购和快速全部赎回交易，之后不留余额且后续不再交易或销户的客户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="私募基金代销业务">
  <data key="d0">私募基金代销业务</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">私募基金代销业务是指证券公司接受私募基金管理公司委托，向投资者销售私募基金产品，并为投资者提供开户、认购、申购、赎回等一系列服务的业务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证监会">
  <data key="d0">证监会</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">证监会是中国证券监督管理委员会，负责监管证券市场和基金产品的登记备案。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中证登">
  <data key="d0">中证登</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中证登是中国证券登记结算有限责任公司，负责非交易过户的条件和要求。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22cbc10b4789c4375306761bebc33a57</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗钱风险点">
  <data key="d0">洗钱风险点</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">洗钱风险点是指证券公司研究人员可能被诱导或贿赂，发布有利于某些上市公司的偏向性报告，导致投资者在市场上进行相关操作，间接促成操纵股价行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="投行业务">
  <data key="d0">投行业务</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">投行业务是金融行业非经纪业务的一部分，主要包括首次公开发行股票保荐承销(IPO)、股权再融资保荐承销、上市公司并购重组财务顾问、债券融资等。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ipo">
  <data key="d0">Ipo</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">IPO(Initial Public Offering)是指一家公司首次向公众投资者发行股票并在证券交易所上市的过程。通过IPO，公司可以从公众投资者那里筹集资金，以支持其业务扩展、偿还债务或其他财务需求。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="证券账户">
  <data key="d0">证券账户</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">证券账户用于参与网下发行的申购和股份的登记，以及持有非限售A股股份和非限售存托凭证，用于计算市值并参与网上申购。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="银行收付款账户">
  <data key="d0">银行收付款账户</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">银行收付款账户用于网下投资者缴纳新股认购资金，以及结算银行办理配售对象的退款。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中国证券登记结算有限责任公司的网下发行专户">
  <data key="d0">中国证券登记结算有限责任公司的网下发行专户</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">中国证券登记结算有限责任公司的网下发行专户用于接受网下投资者认购资金，并在结算系统内开立网下认购资金核算总账户，为各配售对象设立认购资金核算明细账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资金交收账户">
  <data key="d0">资金交收账户</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">资金交收账户(结算备付金账户)用于完成新股认购的资金交收，结算参与人在该账户中完成资金划转。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
