<node id="主承销商的资金交收账户">
  <data key="d0">主承销商的资金交收账户</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">主承销商的资金交收账户接收中国证券登记结算有限责任公司划转的新股认购资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="投资者的资金账户">
  <data key="d0">投资者的资金账户</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">投资者的资金账户用于存放投资者新股认购资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3fb27206ec7233233b5b23b4afce9ec4</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="上市基金流动性服务业务">
  <data key="d0">上市基金流动性服务业务</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">上市基金流动性服务业务是指做市商为基金产品提供流动性服务的业务，包括报价策略、风险控制措施等。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a29debdd1f08d30ff95d3c8efca8dcd2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="交易所">
  <data key="d0">交易所</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">交易所是撮合成交、生成成交数据并发送至中国结算的机构。&lt;SEP&gt;交易所是上市基金流动性业务的交易场所，做市商和基金管理人需遵循其规则和要求。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a29debdd1f08d30ff95d3c8efca8dcd2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197fb378df3b929a466b18f3498b1c69</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="计划财务部">
  <data key="d0">计划财务部</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">计划财务部负责处理做市商的资金需求计划、开户和资金划转审核。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a29debdd1f08d30ff95d3c8efca8dcd2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="清算机构">
  <data key="d0">清算机构</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">清算机构负责交易的清算和结算工作，确保资金和证券的顺利交割。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a29debdd1f08d30ff95d3c8efca8dcd2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="流动性服务协议">
  <data key="d0">流动性服务协议</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">流动性服务协议是做市商与基金管理人之间签订的协议，明确各自的权利和义务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a29debdd1f08d30ff95d3c8efca8dcd2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="专用证券账户">
  <data key="d0">专用证券账户</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">专用证券账户是为了上市基金流动性服务业务而建立的账户，用于交易和资金管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a29debdd1f08d30ff95d3c8efca8dcd2</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Equity Fund">
  <data key="d0">Private Equity Fund</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Private Equity Fund is a type of investment fund that raises capital from specific qualified investors and is not publicly offered. It can be categorized into stock, fixed income, hybrid, futures, and other derivative types.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Public Mutual Fund">
  <data key="d0">Public Mutual Fund</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Public Mutual Fund is an open-ended fund that allows subscription and redemption after a certain period of closed-end operation, typically more liquid than private equity funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Sales Settlement Special Deposit Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Sales Settlement Special Deposit Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">Fund Sales Settlement Special Deposit Account is a dedicated account opened by securities companies in commercial banks for the purpose of aggregating, temporarily storing, and transferring funds during the fund sales process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Raising and Settlement Special Account">
  <data key="d0">Fund Raising and Settlement Special Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">Fund Raising and Settlement Special Account is a dedicated account set up by the share registration agency of a private equity fund, used for the aggregation and payment of funds during the fundraising and existence period of the fund, as well as for the distribution of remaining assets during the liquidation process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Equity Fund Manager">
  <data key="d0">Private Equity Fund Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Private Equity Fund Manager is a company responsible for managing the fundraising, subscription, redemption, investment, and profit distribution of the fund. They must comply with strict legal and regulatory requirements, ensure investment compliance and transparency, and regularly report the fund's operational status and investment performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068934</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Share Registration Agency">
  <data key="d0">Share Registration Agency</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Share Registration Agency is an institution engaged in the registration, custody, and settlement of fund shares.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d6eade66bd8d93ff4d362dcdc8a92a79</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="中信证券">
  <data key="d0">中信证券</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">中信证券是一家提供融券服务并制定证券出借计划的证券公司。&lt;SEP&gt;中信证券是参与融券套利业务的金融机构之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a23cdbeb59683fbabace6dbdbe99e77</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="高瓴资本">
  <data key="d0">高瓴资本</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">高瓴资本是一家投资管理平台，通过其美元二级市场投资管理平台HHLR参与转融通证券出借业务。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="隆基绿能">
  <data key="d0">隆基绿能</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">隆基绿能是HHLR持有并出借其股票的上市公司。&lt;SEP&gt;隆基绿能是一家上市公司，其股票被高瓴资本通过转融通证券出借业务减持。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197fb378df3b929a466b18f3498b1c69</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HHLR">
  <data key="d0">HHLR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">HHLR是高瓴资本旗下美元二级市场投资管理平台，通过转融通证券出借其持有的隆基绿能股票。&lt;SEP&gt;HHLR是高瓴资本旗下美元二级市场投资管理平台，通过转融通证券出借业务减持隆基绿能股票。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-197fb378df3b929a466b18f3498b1c69</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="两大证券交易所">
  <data key="d0">两大证券交易所</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">两大证券交易所修订了转融通证券出借交易业务指南，明确了相关规则。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="限售股不得融券">
  <data key="d0">限售股不得融券</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">限售股不得融券是一项规定，禁止限售股用于融券操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="转融通证券出借">
  <data key="d0">转融通证券出借</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">转融通证券出借是一种证券出借方式，涉及证券在不同实体间的转移。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="定增套利">
  <data key="d0">定增套利</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">定增套利是指通过参与定向增发并利用转融通证券出借业务提前锁定与非公开发行股票折扣价之间的价差收益。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="转融券约定申报">
  <data key="d0">转融券约定申报</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">转融券约定申报是投资者在转融通证券出借业务中的一种申报方式，涉及证券在不同实体间的转移。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acbe382d058e7e8b03f875f44cbcda7a</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
