</node>
<node id="Shenwan Lingxin Fund Management Co., Ltd.">
  <data key="d0">Shenwan Lingxin Fund Management Co., Ltd.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Shenwan Lingxin Fund Management Co., Ltd. (简称“申万菱信基金”) is a fund management company where Xu Yuanhang worked as a fund manager.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7f12cdeb483c7deb72fe0b6a5c6a479</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Xu Yuanhang">
  <data key="d0">Xu Yuanhang</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Xu Yuanhang is a fund manager at Shenwan Lingxin Fund Management Co., Ltd. who obtained non-public information related to the managed fund for insider trading.&lt;SEP&gt;Xu Yuanhang, as the fund manager of SWLX Intelligent Drive Fund, was involved in insider trading using non-public information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a7f12cdeb483c7deb72fe0b6a5c6a479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
