<node id="Credit Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Credit Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">account</data>
  <data key="d2">Credit Securities Account is an account type used in margin trading to record the securities held by the client.&lt;SEP&gt;A credit securities account is opened by an investor at a securities company to record the detailed data of the pledged securities held on behalf of the investor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Credit Securities Account is opened by the securities company for the investor to conduct margin trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7fb11b0587a7113559ef65ba6e8e5d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d77b36439da8f8202fe97a3d1f6b5a70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079</data>
