  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Guarantee Securities are the securities provided by the investor as collateral for margin trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7fb11b0587a7113559ef65ba6e8e5d02</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
