<node id="SEC (Securities and Exchange Commission)">
  <data key="d0">SEC (Securities and Exchange Commission)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The SEC is a U.S. government agency responsible for regulating the securities industry and enforcing securities laws.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7fb11b0587a7113559ef65ba6e8e5d02</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Main Underwriter">
  <data key="d0">Main Underwriter</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Main Underwriter is responsible for market promotion, distribution, and sales of bonds, and collaborates with other underwriters to complete the issuance task.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Other Underwriters">
  <data key="d0">Other Underwriters</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Other Underwriters also bear some issuance risks but have less responsibility and risk compared to the Main Underwriter. They collaborate with the Main Underwriter to complete the issuance task.&lt;SEP&gt;Other Underwriters participate in market promotion, roadshows, and the distribution of bonds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068935</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Trustee Manager">
  <data key="d0">Trustee Manager</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Trustee Manager is responsible for reminding and urging the project team leader to assist the company in timely information disclosure, interest payment, and principal repayment. They also submit semi-annual credit risk management reports to the exchange and coordinate with relevant departments for default risk management and emergency response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Audit Institution">
  <data key="d0">Audit Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Audit Institution conducts independent and objective audits of the issuer's financial statements to ensure accuracy and compliance. They identify and highlight issues and risks, assess internal control systems, and provide continuous supervision after the bond issuance to maintain compliance and operational efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited (CSDC)">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited (CSDC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CSDC is responsible for the registration, settlement, and clearing of bonds, ensuring the safe and effective completion of bond transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e9faa4149e4811536fbaa26f4404f24d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Exchange Traded Fund (Etf)">
  <data key="d0">Exchange Traded Fund (Etf)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Exchange Traded Funds (ETFs) are funds listed on exchanges that provide continuous buy and sell quotes and liquidity support to ensure smooth trading and price stability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liquidity Provider">
  <data key="d0">Liquidity Provider</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Liquidity providers are designated to offer continuous bilateral quotes and other services to ensure the liquidity of the fund in the market.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Specialized Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Specialized Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A specialized securities account is used by liquidity providers to offer continuous bilateral quotes and other services to ensure the liquidity of the fund.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Open-Ended Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Open-Ended Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An open-ended fund account is used by investors to subscribe, purchase, and redeem listed open-ended funds through the fund manager and its distributors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
