</node>
<node id="Settlement Margin/Provisional Payment Account">
  <data key="d0">Settlement Margin/Provisional Payment Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A settlement margin or provisional payment account is required for settlement participants, such as securities firms, fund managers, and their distributors, to participate in settlement business with China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation Limited.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
