</node>
<node id="Clearing Institution">
  <data key="d0">Clearing Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Clearing institutions manage the clearing and settlement process of transactions, ensuring the timely and accurate completion of each transaction, and provide risk management services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-50f0f4aa6acfc957e6d2223114b5e633</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
