  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Clearing and Settlement Corporation">
  <data key="d0">China Clearing and Settlement Corporation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The China Clearing and Settlement Corporation handles the settlement of funds and transfers them to the lead underwriter's account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Special Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An account used by the listed company to manage and use the raised IPO funds for specific purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;A special fund account is set up by the issuer to manage the raised funds for business expansion, project development, and operational management.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Debt Repayment Fund Account">
  <data key="d0">Debt Repayment Fund Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A debt repayment fund account is established by the issuer to store funds for regular debt repayment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
