  <data key="d0">Lu Mouwang</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Lu Mouwang, the chairman of Zhongtong Machinery Manufacturing Co., Ltd., led the financial fraud to issue private placement bonds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9a7158aeec0dad8fd76e33597896e63c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
