<node id="Margin Trading and Securities Lending">
  <data key="d0">Margin Trading and Securities Lending</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Margin Trading and Securities Lending are financial services that allow investors to borrow funds or securities to trade, which can be used for money laundering if not properly controlled.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Identity Verification">
  <data key="d0">Identity Verification</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Identity Verification is the process of confirming the identity of an investor, which may have vulnerabilities if the provided information has multiple changes and lacks a reasonable explanation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Illegal Collateral">
  <data key="d0">Illegal Collateral</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Illegal Collateral refers to assets with unclear or illegal origins that investors may use to secure margin trading and securities lending, potentially enabling money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reverse Trading">
  <data key="d0">Reverse Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Reverse Trading is a technique where an investor sells securities from a credit account and simultaneously buys the same securities from a regular account, often to launder money.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Risk Control">
  <data key="d0">Risk Control</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Risk Control involves the continuous monitoring and management of trading activities to detect and prevent suspicious or illegal activities, such as money laundering.&lt;SEP&gt;Risk Control involves ensuring that investment activities comply with regulatory requirements and taking appropriate hedging measures to reduce potential market risks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bd0a1a4b7684d1f5c307a33d9226d5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Blacklist">
  <data key="d0">Blacklist</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Blacklist is a list of individuals or entities that are flagged for suspicious or illegal activities, used in the client screening process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Credit Account">
  <data key="d0">Credit Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Credit Account is a type of account that allows investors to borrow funds or securities to trade, which can be used for money laundering if not properly controlled.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068936</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regular Account">
  <data key="d0">Regular Account</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The Regular Account is a standard trading account used by investors, which can be involved in reverse trading with the credit account to launder money.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Employee Collusion">
  <data key="d0">Employee Collusion</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Employee Collusion refers to the situation where internal employees of the Securities Company may collude with criminals to relax scrutiny and facilitate illegal activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Client Risk Rating">
  <data key="d0">Client Risk Rating</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Client Risk Rating is a process where the risk level of a client is assessed and adjusted based on suspicious transaction reports and other factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Client Risk Rating involves assessing and categorizing clients based on their risk of involvement in money laundering or terrorist financing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Margin Trading and Short Selling Business">
  <data key="d0">Margin Trading and Short Selling Business</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Margin trading and short selling business involves borrowing funds or securities from a securities company to trade, with ongoing monitoring and long-term cooperation between the securities company and the investor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Credit Cash Account">
  <data key="d0">Credit Cash Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A credit cash account is opened by a custodian bank for an investor to record the detailed data of the pledged funds deposited by the investor.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dedicated Credit Securities Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Dedicated Credit Securities Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A dedicated credit securities settlement account is required for securities companies to conduct margin trading and short selling business on the Shanghai Stock Exchange, used for the settlement of securities in full amount transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dedicated Credit Cash Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Dedicated Credit Cash Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A dedicated credit cash settlement account is required for securities companies to conduct margin trading and short selling business on the Shanghai Stock Exchange, used for the settlement of funds in full amount transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Beijing Stock Exchange">
  <data key="d0">Beijing Stock Exchange</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Beijing Stock Exchange is one of the platforms where securities are listed and traded, and it is involved in the margin trading and short selling business.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Huang Xin">
  <data key="d0">Huang Xin</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Huang Xin is one of the individuals involved in the manipulation of the fiberboard 1910 contract, using his position as a futures specialist at Jiangsu BenNiu Port Group Co., Ltd. to gain and share critical information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jiang Jun">
  <data key="d0">Jiang Jun</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jiang Jun is one of the individuals involved in the manipulation of the fiberboard 1910 contract, working with Huang Xin and Xu Wei to control multiple futures accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Xu Wei">
  <data key="d0">Xu Wei</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Xu Wei is one of the individuals involved in the manipulation of the fiberboard 1910 contract, controlling personal and company futures accounts and sharing critical information with Huang Xin and Jiang Jun.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Changzhou Leishuo Trading Co., Ltd.">
  <data key="d0">Changzhou Leishuo Trading Co., Ltd.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Changzhou Leishuo Trading Co., Ltd. is one of the companies whose futures accounts were controlled by Huang Xin, Jiang Jun, and Xu Wei for the manipulation of the fiberboard 1910 contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Changzhou Changxin Decoration Co., Ltd.">
  <data key="d0">Changzhou Changxin Decoration Co., Ltd.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Changzhou Changxin Decoration Co., Ltd. is one of the companies whose futures accounts were controlled by Huang Xin, Jiang Jun, and Xu Wei for the manipulation of the fiberboard 1910 contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jiangsu BenNiu Port Group Co., Ltd.">
  <data key="d0">Jiangsu BenNiu Port Group Co., Ltd.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Jiangsu BenNiu Port Group Co., Ltd. is the company where Huang Xin worked as a futures specialist, providing him with information advantages used in the manipulation of the fiberboard 1910 contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fiberboard 1910 Contract">
  <data key="d0">Fiberboard 1910 Contract</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Fiberboard 1910 contract is a futures contract that was manipulated by Huang Xin, Jiang Jun, and Xu Wei, leading to a significant increase in its price and substantial profits for the manipulators.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tang Mouhong">
  <data key="d0">Tang Mouhong</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Tang Mouhong is an individual whose personal futures account was controlled by Huang Xin, Jiang Jun, and Xu Wei for the manipulation of the fiberboard 1910 contract.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shanghai Municipal Public Security Bureau Economic Investigation Corps">
  <data key="d0">Shanghai Municipal Public Security Bureau Economic Investigation Corps</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Shanghai Municipal Public Security Bureau Economic Investigation Corps is the law enforcement agency that investigated the case involving the manipulation of futures accounts and the resulting financial losses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chen Moumou">
  <data key="d0">Chen Moumou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Chen Moumou is a professional trader who was reported to the police for causing significant financial losses through fraudulent activities involving futures accounts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hu Moumou">
  <data key="d0">Hu Moumou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Hu Moumou is one of the suspects identified in the case involving the manipulation of futures accounts and the transfer of funds through fraudulent activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ding Moumou">
  <data key="d0">Ding Moumou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Ding Moumou is one of the suspects identified in the case involving the manipulation of futures accounts and the transfer of funds through fraudulent activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zhang Moumou">
  <data key="d0">Zhang Moumou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhang Moumou is one of the suspects identified in the case involving the manipulation of futures accounts and the transfer of funds through fraudulent activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chen Mou">
  <data key="d0">Chen Mou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Chen Mou is the victim who reported to the Shanghai Municipal Public Security Bureau Economic Investigation Corps that his futures account was manipulated, resulting in a significant financial loss.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-814bc6568d5d8731f2af576c94834e13</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Institutional Investors">
  <data key="d0">Institutional Investors</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Institutional investors may use illicit funds to purchase bonds and then transfer them in the secondary market to launder the illegal funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bond Holding by Proxy">
  <data key="d0">Bond Holding by Proxy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bond holding by proxy refers to a third party holding bonds on behalf of the actual owner, with the actual holder still bearing the benefits and risks of the bonds, while the proxy receives a certain benefit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bribery in Bond Underwriting">
  <data key="d0">Bribery in Bond Underwriting</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Bribery in bond underwriting involves employees of securities firms accepting bribes from issuers to help conceal fraudulent activities or taking kickbacks during the underwriting process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mergers and Acquisitions (M&amp;A) Business">
  <data key="d0">Mergers and Acquisitions (M&amp;A) Business</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Mergers and acquisitions business involves securities companies providing professional services such as scheme design and expert opinions for significant M&amp;A activities, including acquisitions, major restructurings, mergers, demergers, and share repurchases, to enhance competitiveness and profitability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Listed Company Account">
  <data key="d0">Listed Company Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The listed company account is used by the acquiring company to manage internal funds and receive external financing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bank Loan Account">
  <data key="d0">Bank Loan Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The bank loan account is set up by banks or financial institutions to handle the disbursement and repayment of loan funds if the acquirer chooses debt financing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Issuance Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Issuance Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The securities issuance account is used to receive funds from investors purchasing securities if the acquirer chooses equity financing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Counterparty Company Account">
  <data key="d0">Counterparty Company Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The counterparty company account is used by the target company to receive the consideration paid by the acquirer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Payment and Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Payment and Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The payment and settlement account is used to handle the payment and settlement of funds in transactions, possibly involving central securities depositories or clearing banks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068937</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Repayment Account">
  <data key="d0">Repayment Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The repayment account is used by the acquirer to repay the principal and interest of debt financing.</data>
