<node id="TA System">
  <data key="d0">TA System</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">The TA System, or Transfer Agent System, is used for confirming investor participation and withdrawal requests, and for processing the transfer of funds between the sales institution and the collective asset management plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
