  <data key="d0">Central Depository and Clearing Corporation (CDCC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CDCC, also known as China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation, manages the TA system and processes the confirmation and clearing of transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
