  <data key="d0">G Securities Asset Management Subsidiary</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">G Securities Asset Management Subsidiary collaborates with a private equity firm to establish an asset management plan, which was involved in market manipulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
