  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Private Equity Firm">
  <data key="d0">Private Equity Firm</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Private Equity Firm, in collaboration with G Securities Asset Management Subsidiary, raised 75.62 million yuan and manipulated the stock market, resulting in a profit of over 4 million yuan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068938</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tiborui Investment Management Company">
  <data key="d0">Tiborui Investment Management Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Tiborui Investment Management Company illegally raised funds through asset management plans and offered various financial products with guaranteed returns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068938</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Asset Management Plan No. 1">
  <data key="d0">Asset Management Plan No. 1</data>
  <data key="d1">plan</data>
  <data key="d2">Asset Management Plan No. 1, established by G Securities Asset Management Subsidiary and a private equity firm, raised 75.62 million yuan and was involved in market manipulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068938</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Taixing Financial Products">
  <data key="d0">Taixing Financial Products</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Taixing Financial Products, including "Taixing Jufu" and "Taixing Taifeng," were offered by Tiborui Investment Management Company with guaranteed returns and were sold to unqualified investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068938</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Centralized Trading Room">
  <data key="d0">Centralized Trading Room</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Centralized Trading Room is where trading instructions from the Securities Company are executed by traders.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="On-Exchange Trading">
  <data key="d0">On-Exchange Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">On-Exchange Trading involves the Investment Manager issuing written or system-based trading instructions, which are then executed by traders.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Off-Exchange Trading">
  <data key="d0">Off-Exchange Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Off-Exchange Trading involves the Investment Manager issuing off-exchange trading instructions to off-exchange traders, who complete the necessary documentation and execution.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Open-Ended Fund Registration and Settlement System (TA System)">
  <data key="d0">Open-Ended Fund Registration and Settlement System (TA System)</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">The Open-Ended Fund Registration and Settlement System, also known as the TA System, is used for confirming investor participation and withdrawal requests and processing fund transfers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (CDCC) TA System">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation (CDCC) TA System</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">The CDCC TA System is part of the China Securities Depository and Clearing Corporation and is responsible for processing the confirmation and clearing of transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self-Built TA System">
  <data key="d0">Self-Built TA System</data>
  <data key="d1">system</data>
  <data key="d2">The Self-Built TA System is used by some companies to confirm and process investor participation and withdrawal requests, and to send the data to sales institutions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liu Mou">
  <data key="d0">Liu Mou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Liu Mou is the legal representative of the private equity firm involved in market manipulation, using controlled accounts and natural person accounts to manipulate stock prices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pang Moumou">
  <data key="d0">Pang Moumou</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Pang Moumou is an individual associated with Tiborui Investment Management Company and was involved in the registration of the company and its illegal fundraising activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-55dfdd2ba206ecea21f2fbd4c0c014a5</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可疑交易">
  <data key="d0">可疑交易</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">可疑交易是指在金融活动中发现的可能涉及洗钱或其他非法活动的交易。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bde91f7dac51fd9740211f5769bf3ed</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资金来源不明">
  <data key="d0">资金来源不明</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">资金来源不明是指投资者使用非法资金进行认购，通过资金筹集环节洗白资金。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bde91f7dac51fd9740211f5769bf3ed</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="员工涉及内幕交易">
  <data key="d0">员工涉及内幕交易</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">员工涉及内幕交易是指项目组人员可能向他人泄露证券发行内幕信息，间接协助他人进行内幕交易，或直接实际控制他人账户进行内幕交易。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bde91f7dac51fd9740211f5769bf3ed</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="北京股权交易中心有限公司">
  <data key="d0">北京股权交易中心有限公司</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">北京股权交易中心有限公司是制定区域性股权市场业务规则的机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bde91f7dac51fd9740211f5769bf3ed</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bell Rock Capital, LLC">
  <data key="d0">Bell Rock Capital, LLC</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Bell Rock Capital, LLC是一家位于特拉华州雷霍博斯海滩的投资公司，被指控不成比例地分配投资收益。&lt;SEP&gt;Bell Rock Capital, LLC是一家总部位于特拉华州雷霍博斯海滩的投资公司，被指控欺骗客户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52b1f72cca6581350cf7ee13bfe210b0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="M. Cassandra Toroian">
  <data key="d0">M. Cassandra Toroian</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">M. Cassandra Toroian是Bell Rock Capital, LLC的负责人，被指控不成比例地分配投资收益并欺骗客户。&lt;SEP&gt;M. Cassandra Toroian是Bell Rock Capital, LLC的负责人，被指控在多年内不成比例地分配投资收益。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-52b1f72cca6581350cf7ee13bfe210b0</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="特拉华州雷霍博斯海滩">
  <data key="d0">特拉华州雷霍博斯海滩</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">特拉华州雷霍博斯海滩是Bell Rock Capital, LLC的总部所在地。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金市场">
  <data key="d0">基金市场</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">基金市场是指投资基金的交易场所，可能存在非法资金流入的风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基金投顾策略">
  <data key="d0">基金投顾策略</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">基金投顾策略是证券公司与投资者签订的投资计划，可能因投资顾问人员的行为而未得到充分披露。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="主交易账户">
  <data key="d0">主交易账户</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">主交易账户是Bell Rock Capital, LLC用于进行证券交易的主要账户，Toroian在此账户中延迟分配证券。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="客户账户">
  <data key="d0">客户账户</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">客户账户是Bell Rock Capital, LLC为客户持有的账户，Toroian将盈利较少和亏损的交易分配到这些账户。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Central Clearing Company">
  <data key="d0">Central Clearing Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Central Clearing Company is responsible for processing bond settlements according to matching instructions from both parties.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Funding Bank">
  <data key="d0">Funding Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Funding Bank is responsible for the timely allocation and transfer of funds for bond transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Clearing Bank">
  <data key="d0">Clearing Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Clearing Bank verifies the funds and transfers them from the fundraising account to the securities company's consolidated account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fixed Income Investment Business Key Process">
  <data key="d0">Fixed Income Investment Business Key Process</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A key process in fixed income investment business, which includes the flow of funds and settlement procedures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Money Laundering or Upstream Crime Case Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Money Laundering or Upstream Crime Case Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Analysis of money laundering or upstream crime cases, currently with no relevant cases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Money Laundering Risk Penetration Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Money Laundering Risk Penetration Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">An analysis of money laundering risks associated with the business and its stakeholders.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Abnormal Trading Behavior">
  <data key="d0">Abnormal Trading Behavior</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Abnormal trading behavior includes actions that influence bond transaction prices or volumes, leading to illegal gains.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="False Declaration">
  <data key="d0">False Declaration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">False declaration involves making large orders and then canceling them to mislead other bond investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Price Manipulation">
  <data key="d0">Price Manipulation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Price manipulation involves making large, continuous, or dense orders at prices significantly deviating from the latest bond transaction price, causing the bond price to rise or fall.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Serious Deviation from Market Prices">
  <data key="d0">Serious Deviation from Market Prices</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">This method involves quoting prices that are significantly different from reasonable market prices to mislead other bond investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self-Dealing">
  <data key="d0">Self-Dealing</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Self-dealing involves frequent or large bond transactions between a single account, controlled accounts, or related accounts, affecting bond prices or transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Unreasonable Transaction Prices">
  <data key="d0">Unreasonable Transaction Prices</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Unreasonable transaction prices involve buying high and selling low, which may be used for transferring benefits through bond transactions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fixed Income Platform">
  <data key="d0">Fixed Income Platform</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Fixed Income Platform is where securities companies conduct bond transactions, including high buy and low sell activities for benefit transfer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="High-Risk Client Management">
  <data key="d0">High-Risk Client Management</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">High-Risk Client Management involves implementing stricter due diligence and monitoring measures for clients with high risk ratings, including limiting their transaction activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Asset Management Contract">
  <data key="d0">Asset Management Contract</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Asset Management Contract is a legal agreement between the Securities Company and the Investor, outlining the terms and conditions of the single asset management service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Single Asset Management Product Custody Account">
  <data key="d0">Single Asset Management Product Custody Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Single Asset Management Product Custody Account is opened by the Securities Custody Company to manage the investor's assets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dedicated Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Dedicated Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The Dedicated Securities Account is a special account opened on behalf of the investor to manage securities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17</data>
