  <data key="d0">Investment Advisor</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An investment advisor is a professional who provides investment advice, must be registered with the China Securities Association, and adheres to compliance and ethical standards.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
