</node>
<node id="Client (Investor)">
  <data key="d0">Client (Investor)</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">The client (investor) is the individual who commissions the securities company to provide investment advice, and their needs, risk preferences, and financial status form the basis of the investment plan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
