<node id="Investment Advisory Service Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Investment Advisory Service Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The investment advisory service agreement is a contract between the securities company and the client, outlining the rights and obligations of both parties.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068940</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Customer Demand Analysis and Evaluation">
  <data key="d0">Customer Demand Analysis and Evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Customer demand analysis and evaluation is the process of understanding the client's basic information, investment goals, and risk preferences, and creating a customer profile.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
