<node id="Investment Execution and Trading">
  <data key="d0">Investment Execution and Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Investment execution and trading is the process where the client confirms the investment plan and executes trades through their securities brokerage account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8748f2b1db1f9215929e49b23dd26948</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
