  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068940</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Taihang Financial Consulting Ji Zhou Branch">
  <data key="d0">Taihang Financial Consulting Ji Zhou Branch</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Taihang Financial Consulting Ji Zhou Branch is one of the branches established by Pan某某to expand illegal fundraising and evade regulatory scrutiny.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2d0120d1425d6042d436cea353e1805c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jin Mou1">
  <data key="d0">Jin Mou1</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jin Mou1 received recommendations and non-public information about "Jinhong Group" from Xu Yuanhang and used it to guide Jin Mou2's trading activities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jin Mou2">
  <data key="d0">Jin Mou2</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Jin Mou2, through the "Jin Mou2" account, bought "Jinhong Group" stocks based on the information provided by Jin Mou1, with a total transaction amount of 4.1106 million yuan.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SWLX Fund Management Co., Ltd.">
  <data key="d0">SWLX Fund Management Co., Ltd.</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SWLX Fund Management Co., Ltd. (shortened as "SWLX Fund") is the company where Xu Yuanhang works as a fund manager.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jinhong Group">
  <data key="d0">Jinhong Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Jinhong Group is a stock that was included in the investment portfolio of the SWLX Intelligent Drive Fund, and it was also the subject of insider trading.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Synchronized Trading">
  <data key="d0">Synchronized Trading</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Synchronized trading refers to the practice of conducting trades in a coordinated manner, often involving the use of non-public information.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tang Mouqing">
  <data key="d0">Tang Mouqing</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Tang Mouqing is the account holder used by Liu Wei to conduct synchronized trades.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="SWLX Intelligent Drive Fund">
  <data key="d0">SWLX Intelligent Drive Fund</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">SWLX Intelligent Drive Fund is the fund managed by Xu Yuanhang, which included "Jinhong Group" in its investment portfolio.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Financial Corporation">
  <data key="d0">Securities Financial Corporation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Securities Financial Corporation, also known as China Securities Finance Corporation, provides funds and securities to securities companies for margin trading and short selling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f041cc71caafcf01504545df5a12ac8</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Margin Trading and Short Selling">
  <data key="d0">Margin Trading and Short Selling</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Margin trading and short selling are financial activities where securities companies provide funds or securities to clients for trading, with specific rules and risk management measures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f041cc71caafcf01504545df5a12ac8</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Lending Business">
  <data key="d0">Securities Lending Business</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Securities lending business involves the lending of securities by securities companies or investors to the Securities Financial Corporation for use in margin trading and short selling.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities Lending Business involves the lending and borrowing of securities between the Securities Company, the Securities Finance Company, and investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f041cc71caafcf01504545df5a12ac8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="2024-07-10 CSRC Announcement">
  <data key="d0">2024-07-10 CSRC Announcement</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">On July 10, 2024, the China Securities Regulatory Commission (CSRC) announced the approval to suspend the securities lending business and increased the margin requirement for short selling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f041cc71caafcf01504545df5a12ac8</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Accounts">
  <data key="d0">Securities Accounts</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Various types of accounts, such as dedicated securities accounts, guarantee securities accounts, and settlement accounts, are used in the securities lending and margin trading business.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f041cc71caafcf01504545df5a12ac8</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Funding Accounts">
  <data key="d0">Funding Accounts</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Funding accounts, such as dedicated funding accounts and guarantee funding accounts, are used to manage the flow of funds in the securities lending and margin trading business.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f041cc71caafcf01504545df5a12ac8</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Finance Company">
  <data key="d0">Securities Finance Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Securities Finance Company is responsible for clearing and settlement of transactions, and it signs agreements with the Securities Company and borrowers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Registration and Settlement Institution">
  <data key="d0">Registration and Settlement Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Registration and Settlement Institution handles the registration, settlement, and custody of securities and funds in the securities lending process.&lt;SEP&gt;Provides share registration and fund settlement services for fund managers or fund sales institutions, including establishing and managing investor fund accounts, registering fund shares, and distributing dividends.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tripartite Business Agreement">
  <data key="d0">Tripartite Business Agreement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Tripartite Business Agreement is a contract signed by the Securities Company, the investor, and the Securities Finance Company, outlining the terms and conditions of the securities lending business.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transferring Securities">
  <data key="d0">Transferring Securities</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Transferring Securities refers to the process of moving securities between different accounts, such as from the Securities Company's account to the Securities Finance Company's dedicated account.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fund Sales Customer">
  <data key="d0">Fund Sales Customer</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Fund sales customers are individuals who provide non-trading transfer proof materials that may contain false information and engage in immediate full redemption of fund products after non-trading transfers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Public Fund Product">
  <data key="d0">Public Fund Product</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Public fund products lack clear investment arrangements, risk-return characteristics, and risk control measures, and may not be registered with the Securities Regulatory Commission.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="False Identity Information">
  <data key="d0">False Identity Information</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">False or forged identity information provided by criminals to open fund accounts and channel illegal funds into the fund market.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Trading Transfer">
  <data key="d0">Non-Trading Transfer</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Non-trading transfer is a method used by criminals to launder money by constructing false facts and forging documents to transfer fund assets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rapid Subscription and Redemption">
  <data key="d0">Rapid Subscription and Redemption</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Rapid subscription and redemption involve buying and selling funds without regard for cost, with abnormal redemption timing or short holding periods, and may include account closure after redemption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc40bbb1d762462c190a313215ef8a3c</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Lender Ordinary Securities Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Lender Ordinary Securities Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The account where the securities lender holds the securities to be lent.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Lender (or Corresponding Settlement Participant) Fund Settlement Account">
  <data key="d0">Securities Lender (or Corresponding Settlement Participant) Fund Settlement Account</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The account used for the securities finance company to pay the borrowing fees, rights compensation, default fines, and transfer funds to the securities lender.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Continuity of Business">
  <data key="d0">Continuity of Business</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The concept that the stock lending and borrowing business is a medium to long-term process, not a one-time financial service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stock Lending and Borrowing Business">
  <data key="d0">Stock Lending and Borrowing Business</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial service involving the lending and borrowing of securities, with a typical duration of up to 182 days for financing and varying terms for securities lending.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Borrower (Securities Company)">
  <data key="d0">Borrower (Securities Company)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A securities company that can act as a borrower, lender, or intermediary providing stock lending and borrowing services to investors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="China Securities Finance Corporation (CSFC)">
  <data key="d0">China Securities Finance Corporation (CSFC)</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial institution in China that provides support services for the stock lending and borrowing business, managing the supply of funds and securities in the market.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Securities Lender">
  <data key="d0">Securities Lender</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">An entity that participates in the stock lending and borrowing business, typically a bank, insurance company, shareholder of a listed company, securities investment fund, social security fund, or securities company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df747faa9eb1a25fbfe59a3e99716b4d</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="(Prospective) Listed Company">
  <data key="d0">(Prospective) Listed Company</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">(Prospective) Listed Company is a company that seeks to be listed on the stock exchange and receives services from the Securities Company, including listing, financing, and underwriting.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Accounting Firm">
  <data key="d0">Accounting Firm</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Accounting Firm conducts financial audits to ensure the accuracy and legality of financial statements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Underwriter">
  <data key="d0">Underwriter</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Underwriter assists in the execution of transactions, manages the transfer of funds, and ensures compliance with legal and transactional requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Board of Directors">
  <data key="d0">Board of Directors</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Board of Directors makes resolutions regarding the specific details of the stock issuance, such as the identity of the subscribers, subscription price, and quantity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Special Project Team">
  <data key="d0">Special Project Team</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Special Project Team is formed to conduct a feasibility analysis and sign a recommendation and continuous supervision agreement with the (prospective) listed company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sponsor Institution">
  <data key="d0">Sponsor Institution</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Sponsor Institution provides ongoing compliance management support to ensure the lawful and compliant operation of the listed company.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7c0f5c987e6b665e08f574c9fa971cf1</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bank">
  <data key="d0">Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Banks are one of the types of institutions covered in the text, involved in various financial services.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
  <data key="d4">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d5">1780068941</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Third-Party Fund Sales">
  <data key="d0">Third-Party Fund Sales</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Third-party fund sales organizations are involved in the distribution and sale of mutual funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0d12e280833046d066b7aaf24d66d3be</data>
