<edge source="证券公司" target="投资者">
  <data key="d8">9.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relationship between 投资者 (investors) and 证券公司 (securities companies) is multifaceted, involving a range of services and interactions. Investors open fund and cash accounts with securities companies to record their holdings in publicly offered funds and to manage the transfer of related funds. Securities companies provide customer service and information disclosure, which helps investors make informed investment decisions. Additionally, they offer a variety of financial services, including the subscription and allocation of new stock issues, allowing investors to purchase securities during initial public offerings. They also assist with the coordination, order processing, price determination, and allocation of refinancing products, as well as highly customized asset management services that include portfolio design, asset allocation, risk control, market research, and analysis.

However, the relationship can also be marred by potential misconduct. Securities companies may, due to subjective factors such as bribery or self-interest, or objective factors like insufficient qualifications or errors in judgment, provide unfair or incorrect investment advice. They might also use fraudulent methods, such as disclosing false reports, to lure investors into investing in certain assets, thereby illegally profiting. Furthermore, there are instances where investment advisors at securities companies may unfairly distribute investment returns among different clients. In some cases, investors might use the large fee transfers associated with investment advisory services to launder illicit funds. Additionally, securities companies may introduce clients to futures companies and assist in setting up futures brokerage accounts, further expanding the scope of their services.</data>
  <data key="d10">不公平分配,信息披露,协助开户,基金账户,客户引荐,客户服务,投资顾问,新股申购,服务提供,洗钱风险,认购协调,资产管理,资金账户,配售,金融服务</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9ab4a8664b06ca8c516dd82f42c3f0fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c814bd3ee4b28cc811b0db9eb1dd67d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d521d63f0ac28594a1331282ec004b90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3129ffad694106512445daf2c43df992&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6179dd000906fd92dc3a66c459946ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e59a8775f2db8fff8b654190338ab6f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82ddd5729ad3bfe1c8e0c43dddc95088</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
