<edge source="Securities Crime" target="Money Laundering">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Securities crime and money laundering are interconnected, with both involving the misuse of financial systems.</data>
  <data key="d10">financial crime,illegal activities</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Bond Issuance">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Bond issuance can be used as a method to launder illegal funds by issuing debt financing tools and purchasing them under others' names.</data>
  <data key="d10">financial tool,illegal activity</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Liquidity Service">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Liquidity services can be used for money laundering by mixing illegal funds with legitimate market activities.</data>
  <data key="d10">illicit activity,money laundering</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-f0d58f84cfc22955fe262c14dd9d34ef</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068944</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Client">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Clients may attempt to launder money by directing funds to third parties, posing a risk to the securities company.</data>
  <data key="d10">financial crime,risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068952</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Private Equity Funds">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Private equity funds, due to their high entry barriers and low liquidity, pose a lower risk for money laundering compared to public mutual funds.</data>
  <data key="d10">regulation,risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068954</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Public Mutual Funds">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Public mutual funds, due to their higher liquidity and lower entry barriers, pose a higher risk for money laundering.</data>
  <data key="d10">regulation,risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-47784440a5a8d45f7d5d835aede3da73</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068954</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Non-Transaction Transfer">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Non-transaction transfers, such as false inheritances or gifts, can be used to launder illegal gains.</data>
  <data key="d10">false transfer,laundering</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2ee3b0210e973d3725a10ad55081dd7f</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068956</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Shanghai Sierxin Technology">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Shanghai Sierxin Technology's actions, including the falsification of financial data, can be associated with money laundering risks.</data>
  <data key="d10">financial crime,regulatory violation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b76cb9d596e1bbda44d3d73e725e1c9c</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068959</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Futures Company">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Futures companies may facilitate money laundering by allowing illegal activities such as the use of multiple accounts for joint trades and knock trades.</data>
  <data key="d10">facilitation,illegal activity</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-51656729fd95d8c8159c32833c445930</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068962</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="刘汉">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">刘汉通过并购活动将非法所得混入上市公司，实现资金清洗。</data>
  <data key="d10">control,illegal funds</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-c4fb72119f9dbf295f128313c2793d9a</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068970</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Synchronized Trading">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Synchronized trading can be a part of money laundering activities, posing a risk in the fund management industry.</data>
  <data key="d10">financial crime,risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068971</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Money Laundering" target="Insider Trading">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Insider trading can be a precursor to money laundering, as it generates illicit profits that may be laundered.</data>
  <data key="d10">financial crime,risk</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-a0a629b4d3e1e1458cb010f20fc5e1e6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068972</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Bond Issuance" target="Tokyo Electric Power Company (Tepco)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Tokyo Electric Power Company (TEPCO) misused funds raised from bond issuance by transferring them to offshore accounts and investing in fake projects.</data>
  <data key="d10">company,financial misconduct</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Tokyo Electric Power Company (Tepco)" target="Illegal Fund Transfer">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Tokyo Electric Power Company (TEPCO) was involved in illegal fund transfers by moving raised funds to offshore accounts and investing in false projects.</data>
  <data key="d10">company,financial misconduct</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Aig" target="Financial Audit">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">AIG engaged in fraudulent financial disclosure, which was revealed through financial audits, leading to a significant drop in stock prices and legal actions against executives.</data>
  <data key="d10">company,financial fraud</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Aig" target="False Financial Disclosure">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">AIG engaged in false financial disclosure to maintain bond prices and investor confidence, which was later exposed, leading to legal consequences.</data>
  <data key="d10">company,financial fraud</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Due Diligence" target="Anti-Money Laundering Blacklist">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Due diligence includes checking if the issuer or investor is on the anti-money laundering blacklist to prevent financial crimes.</data>
  <data key="d10">compliance,risk management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Due Diligence" target="Suspicious Transaction Monitoring">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Suspicious transaction monitoring is part of due diligence to identify and report potential illegal or fraudulent financial activities.</data>
  <data key="d10">compliance,risk management</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-3b9ab50b39faa9a7ea2e9a0b247fd0b6</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068942</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Due Diligence" target="Securities Company">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The securities company, as a sponsor, conducts due diligence to assess the issuer's operations, financials, and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The securities company conducts a comprehensive due diligence process to gather and verify information about the potential listed company.&lt;SEP&gt;The securities company conducts due diligence to verify the identity and intentions of the transaction counterparty.</data>
  <data key="d10">assessment,compliance,due diligence,investigation,preparation,verification</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8563f6fdff49f6330074f1e3fc3bfb32&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa10ac6c596984d988e618579961eec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d1b26282ba6a164c58d78cc82cfdd6d</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068954</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Due Diligence" target="Issuer">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Due Diligence is conducted on the Issuer to verify financial and operational information, including checks on shareholders and business transactions.</data>
  <data key="d10">financial verification,operational check</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068959</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Suspicious Transaction Monitoring" target="Securities Company">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Securities Company must systematically and manually review transactions to identify and report any suspicious or potentially illegal activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The securities company must implement suspicious transaction monitoring to detect and prevent illegal activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities Company implements Suspicious Transaction Monitoring to detect and report suspicious transactions, such as unexplained delays in receiving investor funds.&lt;SEP&gt;The Securities Company uses Suspicious Transaction Monitoring to detect and report abnormal trading behaviors, such as false declarations and price manipulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The securities company implements suspicious transaction monitoring to detect and report any suspicious activities.</data>
  <data key="d10">compliance,detection,monitoring,reporting,risk management,transaction review</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-698d75d0b6c32d861c93dc8b1c01fcef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37a633ca2c898d0accb80c4c61a574ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b337ab083faebc2716550f11e31aed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d1b26282ba6a164c58d78cc82cfdd6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-860a814757cca315157592a40fdbbd70</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068952</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Suspicious Transaction Monitoring" target="Issuer">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Suspicious Transaction Monitoring is used to detect and report unusual trading activities by the Issuer, which may indicate insider trading or market manipulation.</data>
  <data key="d10">reporting,unusual trading</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-ff6f31a278938f12b825c13bc6a7bd90</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068959</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Suspicious Transaction Monitoring" target="Institutional Investors">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Institutional investors' transactions are monitored for suspicious activities, such as rapid transfers of bonds at significantly different prices or unclear sources of funds.</data>
  <data key="d10">regulatory compliance,transaction monitoring</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b2dcb35547a3fcb5897680915a641526</data>
  <data key="d12">1.5证券业精细化洗钱风险管控体系建设研究报告.docx</data>
  <data key="d13">1780068967</data>
