<edge source="Anti-Money Laundering Blacklist" target="Securities Company">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Securities Company screens counterparties against the Anti-Money Laundering Blacklist to ensure they are not involved in suspicious activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The securities company uses the anti-money laundering blacklist to screen and identify potential money laundering risks.</data>
