<edge source="Client Due Diligence" target="Securities Company">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Securities Company must conduct thorough client due diligence to verify the identity and background of investors, ensuring compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities companies must perform client due diligence to verify the legitimacy of their clients and their transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities Company performs Client Due Diligence to ensure the fund manager and their products are registered and compliant with regulations.</data>
