<edge source="Securities Company" target="Custodian Bank">
  <data key="d8">6.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Custodian banks manage credit cash accounts for investors and work with securities companies to ensure the transparency and security of transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Custodian Bank provides tripartite custody services and transaction settlement services to the Securities Company.&lt;SEP&gt;The Securities Company signs service agreements with the Custodian Bank for the custody of securities and funds.&lt;SEP&gt;The Securities Company works with the Custodian Bank to verify and transfer the investor's assets.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities Company manages its funds through the Custodian Bank, which ensures the safety and proper handling of the funds.&lt;SEP&gt;Securities companies use custodian banks to transfer funds between bank custody accounts and derivatives trading accounts, ensuring the safety and transparency of fund flows.</data>
  <data key="d10">asset verification,custody,custody services,financial management,fund transfer,funds management,security,service agreement,supervision,transaction settlement,transfer,transparency</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-aa64becf725706fe4863f0862f3a6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb11b0587a7113559ef65ba6e8e5d02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be4853d73f55dbee5a39e138f9738079&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ec18b664ecf3e882043bc0024559c17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9bd0a1a4b7684d1f5c307a33d9226d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a847dfe2775f29788ef106c84c01b8d</data>
